01:07:00,605 --> 01:07:04,230
<i>Without friendship, where is peace?</i>

1241
01:07:04,521 --> 01:07:07,855
<i>What moonlight can life offer?</i>

1242
01:07:08,396 --> 01:07:11,980
<i>Hand in hand, we drift like fireflies</i>

1243
01:07:12,355 --> 01:07:15,521
<i>My heart is veiled in the morning mist</i>

1244
01:07:16,355 --> 01:07:19,771
<i>Where the heart dwells,
Time stands still</i>

1245
01:07:19,938 --> 01:07:23,813
<i>Time flutters by on delicate wings</i>

1246
01:07:24,021 --> 01:07:28,230
<i>Some journeys turn beautiful
When hearts unite…</i>

1247
01:07:43,855 --> 01:07:48,563
Lara Dominic,
do you take Sachin as your husband?

1248
01:07:49,105 --> 01:07:50,855
- Hey, say no.
- Lado, no!

1249
01:07:51,063 --> 01:07:52,646
- Say no!
- He brought a Father!

1250
01:07:52,771 --> 01:07:53,688
- Yes, Father!
- No…

1251
01:07:54,855 --> 01:07:56,355
- Sachin, do you take Lara--
- Yes, Father!

1252
01:07:56,980 --> 01:07:58,396
- Can I kiss the bride?
- Wait, wait, wait!

1253
01:08:00,230 --> 01:08:01,187
Looking for this?

1254
