<i>With memories lingering,
I stood in a different hue</i>

1260
01:08:38,896 --> 01:08:40,271
I request Doctor Noran

1261
01:08:40,396 --> 01:08:43,605
to distribute the convocation certificates
to the Department of Gynecologists.

1262
01:08:43,896 --> 01:08:45,230
Dr. Lara Dominic.

1263
01:08:47,313 --> 01:08:49,187
- Brother, you look happy!
- Congrats, Sachin, bro.

1264
01:08:49,188 --> 01:08:50,146
Dr. Priyanka.

1265
01:08:58,771 --> 01:09:00,605
- Wow! Wow! Wow!
- I am a doctor now.

1266
01:09:00,730 --> 01:09:02,270
From now on,
you'll handle the pregnancies.

1267
01:09:02,271 --> 01:09:03,479
And I'll handle the infants.

1268
01:09:03,480 --> 01:09:04,645
Bro, what do you mean?

1269
01:09:04,646 --> 01:09:06,604
She's a Gynecologist,
and I'm a Pediatrician.

1270
01:09:06,605 --> 01:09:07,937
- Oh, right!
- Ah, I get it.

1271
01:09:07,938 --> 01:09:09,688
So, this was your plan all along.

1272
01:09:09,938 --> 01:09:10,937
Well planned.

1273
01:09:10,938 --> 01:09:12,480
- Not bad!
- Dr. Amudha.

1274
01:09:13,063 --> 01:09:13,980
Hey!

1275
01:09:21,396 --> 01:09:24,813
How long will you keep romancing
through just your eyes?

1276
01:09:25,521 --> 01:09:27,313
Open your mouth
and profess your love for her.

1277
01:09:27,480 --> 01:09:28,480
I will!

1278
01:09:29,480 --> 01:09:30,480
When are you going to tell her?

1279
01:09:31,105 --> 01:09:32,813
She's more scared than you.

1280
01:09:33,271 --> 01:09:34,980
You must initiate.

1281
01:09:35,521 --> 01:09:37,355
I, too, wish to propose to her.

1282
01:09:38,313 --> 01:09:39,855
I will propose when the time is right.

1283
01:09:40,896 --> 01:09:42,730
This is your last chance.

1284
01:09:43,146 --> 01:09:44,521
She is going back to her hometown.

1285
01:09:44,938 --> 01:09:46,438
For God's sake, propose to her now.

1286
01:09:47,313 --> 01:09:48,938
If you miss now, she won't return.

1287
01:09:52,521 --> 01:09:54,355
I will propose to her
before she leaves town.

1288
01:09:54,563 --> 01:09:55,480
Enough?

1289
01:09:56,855 --> 01:09:58,437
He will never say it. I'll tell her.

1290
01:09:58,438 --> 01:09:59,605
- Hey!
- Stop being stupid.

1291
01:10:00,438 --> 01:10:01,563
I'm not the old Idhaya anymore.

1292
01:10:01,688 --> 01:10:03,146
Wait and watch,
this time I'll tell her.

1293
01:10:05,021 --> 01:10:05,980
All the best!

1294
01:10:09,396 --> 01:10:11,146
- What time is your train?
- At night, 8 pm.

1295
01:10:12,480 --> 01:10:14,063
So, Uncle, what's next?

1296
01:10:14,188 --> 01:10:16,230
It's her life.
She must make the decision.

1297
01:10:16,563 --> 01:10:17,895
What are you thinking about?

1298
01:10:17,896 --> 01:10:20,771
Didn't you say you're moving
to the UK and settling down there?

1299
01:10:21,146 --> 01:10:24,146
No, Prabhu,
I'm thinking of settling down in India.

1300
01:10:24,563 --> 01:10:26,270
I can't miss being in Chennai.

1301
01:10:26,271 --> 01:10:28,979
Moreover,
I can't leave Dad alone and go far…

1302
01:10:28,980 --> 01:10:30,645
So, is it marriage next?

1303
01:10:30,646 --> 01:10:32,104
She has to take a call about it.

1304
01:10:32,105 --> 01:10:35,646
Dear, do you like any doctor on campus?
Let's get you married to him.

1305
01:10:35,813 --> 01:10:39,521
No, I may marry anyone except a doctor.

1306
01:10:39,730 --> 01:10:41,938
Okay, right!

1307
01:10:44,646 --> 01:10:46,645
You marry as per your choice.

1308
01:10:46,646 --> 01:10:49,230
My only wish is for him
to look after you well.

1309
01:10:49,563 --> 01:10:51,771
- Yes, yes.
- Sir, as per your expectations,

1310
01:10:52,063 --> 01:10:54,104
to find a groom
who'd take good care of your daughter,

1311
01:10:54,105 --> 01:10:55,687
we at Wedding Art wish you the best.

1312
01:10:55,688 --> 01:10:57,562
<i>This is Wedding Art…</i>

1313
01:10:57,563 --> 01:10:59,438
- You guys keep talking. I'll bring my bag.
- Okay, Dad.

1314
01:11:00,021 --> 01:11:01,313
- Why, guys?
- Just for fun!

1315
01:11:01,605 --> 01:11:02,813
Hey, go and speak to him.

1316
01:11:03,105 --> 01:11:04,979
Try impressing your future father-in-law.

1317
01:11:04,980 --> 01:11:06,063
- Go, dude.
- Oh, really?

1318
01:11:14,896 --> 01:11:15,896
What are you looking at, sir?

1319
01:11:16,855 --> 01:11:21,605
It'll be beautiful
if you all stay together like this.

1320
01:11:24,938 --> 01:11:27,396
Ten years down the line,
we'd be the same.

1321
01:11:28,396 --> 01:11:30,855
If it happens, it'll be wonderful.
But it's not practical.

1322
01:11:31,771 --> 01:11:33,188
In the future, everything will change.

1323
01:11:33,605 --> 01:11:35,980
Each of you will pursue
different paths in life.

1324
01:11:36,313 --> 01:11:38,938
This auditorium will be filled
with a new set of friends.

1325
01:11:40,188 --> 01:11:41,105
We…

1326
01:11:44,146 --> 01:11:48,480
Why do I get the feeling that you've
kept something locked up in your heart?

1327
01:11:51,396 --> 01:11:56,230
Son, the moments
that slip away in life never return.

1328
01:11:57,605 --> 01:12:03,980
If we stay true to ourselves right now,
we won't regret it later.

1329
01:12:04,605 --> 01:12:07,313
So, whether it's happiness or sadness…

1330
01:12:08,021 --> 01:12:09,521
Speak your heart.

1331
01:12:10,230 --> 01:12:11,521
Don't keep postponing it.

1332
01:12:22,771 --> 01:12:24,938
I thought there was a party,
but I don't see anyone around.

1333
01:12:25,063 --> 01:12:26,188
Let's begin the party!

1334
01:12:26,980 --> 01:12:28,646
- It's not like that.
- Then how?

1335
01:12:28,938 --> 01:12:30,896
- Let's go.
- What happened?

1336
01:12:31,021 --> 01:12:32,563
Fine, I'll help Uncle.

1337
01:12:32,688 --> 01:12:33,605
Okay.

1338
01:12:34,021 --> 01:12:36,062
Bro! Why is Lado pissed at you?

1339
01:12:36,063 --> 01:12:37,979
We've been fighting.
She blocked me everywhere.

1340
01:12:37,980 --> 01:12:39,395
Forget about her.
Where's our guy?

1341
01:12:39,396 --> 01:12:41,812
- He's writing.
- What is he writing?

1342
01:12:41,813 --> 01:12:44,229
- He's writing a song.
- Song? He never mentioned it.

1343
01:12:44,230 --> 01:12:46,104
Yes, bro!
He's going to propose through a song.

1344
01:12:46,105 --> 01:12:47,145
Proposal song, you say?

1345
01:12:47,146 --> 01:12:48,563
- Oh, damn!
- Wait, I'll be back.

1346
01:12:49,771 --> 01:12:51,271
Hey, won't you even say sorry?

1347
01:12:51,855 --> 01:12:53,979
- Only I have to initiate it.
- What's your problem?

1348
01:12:53,980 --> 01:12:55,062
This is my problem.

1349
01:12:55,063 --> 01:12:57,187
When I'm with you,
have you ever put in any effort?

1350
01:12:57,188 --> 01:13:00,605
Look at him. For his love,
he's throwing a farewell party for us.

1351
01:13:00,730 --> 01:13:03,146
Have you ever
put in any effort like this?

1352
01:13:03,313 --> 01:13:04,980
You mean to say
I never did anything for you?

1353
01:13:05,230 --> 01:13:06,687
Didn't put in any effort?

1354
01:13:06,688 --> 01:13:08,895
Look at this silly girl.
Tell her about that matter.

1355
01:13:08,896 --> 01:13:09,813
What matter?

1356
01:13:10,605 --> 01:13:12,646
Hey, tell her about the song.

1357
01:13:13,063 --> 01:13:16,230
Hey, Lado,
bro has written a song for you.

1358
01:13:16,563 --> 01:13:17,604
- Oh, oh!
- Yes, baby.

1359
01:13:17,605 --> 01:13:20,105
He's going to sing a song
without stopping for a breath, for you.

1360
01:13:20,313 --> 01:13:22,521
- Dude, why would you?
- Is it true?

1361
01:13:23,021 --> 01:13:25,605
- Yes, wait and see.
- What are you going to sing?

1362
01:13:45,646 --> 01:13:48,771
<i>O beautiful parrot-like one
My beautiful little one</i>

1363
01:13:48,896 --> 01:13:52,480
<i>My treasured jewel,
Nesting in my tiny heart</i>

1364
01:13:52,980 --> 01:13:56,105
<i>O sculpted beauty…
My sculpted beauty</i>

1365
01:13:56,230 --> 01:13:59,521
<i>I want to be known in town
As your lover</i>

1366
01:13:59,688 --> 01:14:02,980
<i>I wish to be beside you
When the wedding bells ring</i>

1367
01:14:03,230 --> 01:14:06,563
<i>I long to see you
Blush beside me on that day</i>

1368
01:14:06,813 --> 01:14:10,521
<i>I want you etched
Beside my heart like a tattoo</i>

1369
01:14:10,646 --> 01:14:14,271
<i>I want to recite a poem</i>

1370
01:14:14,646 --> 01:14:16,355
<i>Hey, stunning beauty
O ravishing beauty</i>

1371
01:14:17,813 --> 01:14:19,896
<i>Hey, stunning beauty
O ravishing beauty</i>

1372
01:14:21,396 --> 01:14:24,896
<i>My stunning beauty,
The moment your eyes open</i>

1373
01:14:25,063 --> 01:14:28,688
<i>A single glance,
And you swept into my heart</i>

1374
01:14:28,980 --> 01:14:32,146
<i>Like a feast prepared
By a charming beauty</i>

1375
01:14:32,355 --> 01:14:35,813
<i>This lovely maiden
Is a spark of sheer bliss</i>

1376
01:14:36,355 --> 01:14:39,480
<i>Do you hesitate to confess your love,
Or are you simply spellbound?</i>

1377
01:14:39,896 --> 01:14:43,438
<i>Can a girl be just as smitten
As a boy?</i>

1378
01:14:43,646 --> 01:14:47,063
<i>Do thoughts of you melt my heart,
Or is it your closeness within?</i>

1379
01:14:47,230 --> 01:14:50,605
<i>If it's life's gift,
What more is there to say?</i>

1380
01:14:50,771 --> 01:14:54,021
<i>Come set my heart alight
Bring the match and strike it</i>

1381
01:14:54,146 --> 01:14:55,687
<i>Come and hold me close</i>

1382
01:14:55,688 --> 01:14:57,646
<i>With your father's blessing,
I'll make you mine</i>

1383
01:14:57,813 --> 01:14:59,354
<i>Come by my side</i>

1384
01:14:59,355 --> 01:15:01,396
<i>Let me proudly show you to my friends</i>

1385
01:15:01,521 --> 01:15:05,063
<i>Come, accept my love
Let me make you part of my family</i>

1386
01:15:39,855 --> 01:15:42,105
Hey, weren't you supposed
to sing without taking a breath?

1387
01:15:42,896 --> 01:15:43,813
Come on, sing.

1388
01:15:44,105 --> 01:15:45,896
Oh, yeah, I forgot about it.

1389
01:15:46,813 --> 01:15:47,855
I will do it for the next verse.

1390
01:15:48,313 --> 01:15:50,062
<i>A bouquet woven
From clustered blooms</i>

1391
01:15:50,063 --> 01:15:51,687
<i>A precious gem adorned with pearls</i>

1392
01:15:51,688 --> 01:15:53,520
<i>Beholding beauty
That enchants all around</i>

1393
01:15:53,521 --> 01:15:55,354
<i>A masterpiece
Adorned with delicate strokes</i>

1394
01:15:55,355 --> 01:15:57,145
<i>Graced by the moon's glow
And a river of gold</i>

1395
01:15:57,146 --> 01:15:58,855
<i>Beneath the moonlight,
Only truth remains</i>

1396
01:15:59,105 --> 01:16:01,020
<i>The joy here is beyond words</i>

1397
01:16:01,021 --> 01:16:02,354
<i>Where is your part in this joy,
My dear?</i>

1398
01:16:02,355 --> 01:16:03,979
<i>Do we embrace it,
Or set it free?</i>

1399
01:16:03,980 --> 01:16:05,729
<i>Will you scorn me,
Or embrace me?</i>

1400
01:16:05,730 --> 01:16:07,438
<i>Shall we learn to live in harmony?</i>

1401
01:16:07,563 --> 01:16:09,105
<i>Shall we fill our home with children?</i>

1402
01:16:09,271 --> 01:16:10,813
<i>Come along, my darling wife</i>

1403
01:16:11,021 --> 01:16:12,646
<i>I'll be waiting, eager as ever</i>

1404
01:16:12,855 --> 01:16:14,688
<i>A charm too precious to let go</i>

1405
01:16:14,896 --> 01:16:17,521
<i>I'll cherish and protect you forever</i>

1406
01:16:20,730 --> 01:16:24,188
<i>My stunning beauty,
The moment your eyes open</i>

1407
01:16:24,355 --> 01:16:28,021
<i>A single glance,
And you swept into my heart</i>

1408
01:16:28,188 --> 01:16:31,230
<i>Like a feast prepared
By a charming beauty</i>

1409
01:16:31,396 --> 01:16:35,063
<i>This lovely maiden
Is a spark of sheer bliss</i>

1410
01:16:35,563 --> 01:16:38,980
<i>Do you hesitate to confess your love,
Or are you simply spellbound?</i>

1411
01:16:39,188 --> 01:16:42,313
<i>Can a girl be just as smitten
As a boy?</i>

1412
01:16:42,771 --> 01:16:46,271
<i>Do thoughts of you melt my heart,
Or is it your closeness within?</i>

1413
01:16:46,438 --> 01:16:49,938
<i>If it's life's gift,
What more is there to say?</i>

1414
01:16:50,063 --> 01:16:53,354
<i>Come set my heart alight
Bring the match and strike it</i>

1415
01:16:53,355 --> 01:16:54,855
<i>Come and hold me close</i>

1416
01:16:54,980 --> 01:16:56,730
<i>With your father's blessing,
I'll make you mine</i>

1417
01:16:56,855 --> 01:16:58,645
<i>Come by my side</i>

1418
01:16:58,646 --> 01:17:00,480
<i>Let me proudly show you to my friends</i>

1419
01:17:00,646 --> 01:17:04,230
<i>Come, accept my love
Let me make you part of my family...</i>

1420
01:17:15,771 --> 01:17:17,062
<i>On that day, we didn't realize</i>

1421
01:17:17,063 --> 01:17:19,688
<i>that would be the last day
we were together.</i>

1422
01:17:38,313 --> 01:17:40,438
Hereafter, I won't need this key.

1423
01:17:43,855 --> 01:17:44,938
I'll miss you, Lado.

1424
01:17:53,938 --> 01:17:55,105
- Bye.
- Bye.

1425
01:17:56,105 --> 01:17:57,063
Aren't you coming?

1426
01:17:58,396 --> 01:17:59,313
I'll cry.

1427
01:18:01,396 --> 01:18:02,313
Okay.

1428
01:18:07,230 --> 01:18:09,271
Dude, you only have 35 minutes.

1429
01:18:09,396 --> 01:18:11,479
Before the Alappuzha Express
steals her away,

1430
01:18:11,480 --> 01:18:13,105
you reserve your chance
and confirm your love.

1431
01:18:13,230 --> 01:18:14,438
Hey, shut up!

1432
01:18:14,896 --> 01:18:16,146
Look, hear me out.

1433
01:18:16,313 --> 01:18:18,938
A railway station is the apt place
to propose your love.

1434
01:18:19,063 --> 01:18:20,813
<i>Mouna Ragam</i>: Karthik and Revathi.

1435
01:18:21,021 --> 01:18:24,021
<i>Dilwale Dulhania Le Jaayenge</i>:
Shahrukh and Kajol.

1436
01:18:24,438 --> 01:18:27,188
Then, <i>Kadhal Kottai</i>:
Devayani and Ajith.

1437
01:18:27,313 --> 01:18:30,105
A railway station
is the perfect spot to confess your love.

1438
01:18:30,438 --> 01:18:33,188
But when I see the railway station,
I only remember <i>Moondram Pirai</i>.

1439
01:18:33,313 --> 01:18:36,396
Instead of speaking nonsense, please tell
her those three words without hesitation.

1440
01:18:36,521 --> 01:18:38,188
- Okay? Amudha!
- Hey!

1441
01:18:39,230 --> 01:18:40,521
He wants to talk to you.

1442
01:18:42,521 --> 01:18:43,521
Don't mess it up.

1443
01:18:46,146 --> 01:18:47,063
What is it?

1444
01:18:47,563 --> 01:18:49,855
You guys keep talking.
Meanwhile, I'll get the platform tickets.

1445
01:18:54,313 --> 01:18:55,230
Tell me, Idhaya.

1446
01:18:57,105 --> 01:18:58,021
Hand me the bag.

1447
01:18:58,563 --> 01:18:59,480
I'll carry it.

1448
01:20:51,271 --> 01:20:52,688
- I'm sorry, sir.
- Watch out.

1449
01:20:52,896 --> 01:20:53,813
Sorry!

1450
01:20:54,271 --> 01:20:55,188
You…

1451
01:20:56,230 --> 01:20:57,230
When I see you,

1452
01:20:57,605 --> 01:20:59,980
it reminds me
of my friend from college.

1453
01:21:00,438 --> 01:21:01,438
Oh, okay, sir.

1454
01:21:12,313 --> 01:21:13,396
Are you checking your weight?

1455
01:21:13,688 --> 01:21:15,813
No! I'm checking what's in store for me.

1456
01:21:20,646 --> 01:21:21,563
What's written on it?

1457
01:21:21,855 --> 01:21:22,813
I won't tell.

1458
01:21:23,521 --> 01:21:24,480
Show!

1459
01:21:25,271 --> 01:21:26,188
Why don't you try?

1460
01:21:26,771 --> 01:21:27,771
I don't believe in it.

1461
01:21:28,063 --> 01:21:29,105
Please check.

1462
01:21:34,438 --> 01:21:35,437
Show!

1463
01:21:35,438 --> 01:21:36,813
- Show me the card.
- You didn't show yours.

1464
01:21:37,771 --> 01:21:38,855
You did not.

1465
01:21:39,146 --> 01:21:41,480
Reverse on me, huh!
Let's go!

1466
01:22:38,813 --> 01:22:39,771
All okay?

1467
01:23:00,021 --> 01:23:01,521
I got scared
that the train had really started.

1468
01:23:06,313 --> 01:23:07,396
So, what's next for you?

1469
01:23:12,146 --> 01:23:14,605
Not sure.
I'll get home and figure it out.

1470
01:23:16,646 --> 01:23:18,688
I'm going to miss you all.

1471
01:23:19,230 --> 01:23:21,188
It felt as though
everything had just begun.

1472
01:23:21,896 --> 01:23:22,896
But so soon…

1473
01:23:24,896 --> 01:23:26,146
You're going away on the train.

1474
01:23:27,021 --> 01:23:30,396
But I don't know why I feel like
I'm going to miss the train.

1475
01:23:33,563 --> 01:23:35,188
Before we knew it,
time had flown by.

1476
01:23:40,230 --> 01:23:41,563
What are your plans after this?

1477
01:23:42,188 --> 01:23:43,438
I have a lot of plans in mind.

1478
01:23:44,230 --> 01:23:45,855
But before that…

1479
01:23:46,313 --> 01:23:48,855
I would like to tell you
something important…

1480
01:23:50,438 --> 01:23:51,396
Do you have water?

1481
01:23:52,563 --> 01:23:53,480
No.

1482
01:23:54,021 --> 01:23:55,688
Shall I get you some water?

1483
01:23:56,396 --> 01:23:57,313
Wait!

1484
01:24:01,563 --> 01:24:03,313
- Brother, one bottle.
- What else?

1485
01:24:03,980 --> 01:24:05,230
Also, a pack of biscuits.

1486
01:24:18,771 --> 01:24:19,688
Here you go.

1487
01:24:20,688 --> 01:24:21,605
Hold this.

1488
01:24:23,230 --> 01:24:24,146
You're getting a call.

1489
01:24:24,688 --> 01:24:27,896
- It's okay, it's Dad. I'll get it later.
- Okay.

1490
01:24:28,938 --> 01:24:29,855
I…

1491
01:24:36,646 --> 01:24:37,605
I think it's time.

1492
01:24:38,271 --> 01:24:39,688
The train is about to leave.

1493
01:24:40,438 --> 01:24:41,521
There are still five minutes.

1494
01:24:42,521 --> 01:24:43,688
You're very late!

1495
01:24:44,688 --> 01:24:45,980
And your watch is slow as well.

1496
01:24:53,480 --> 01:24:55,063
The train is about to leave.
Tell her quickly.

1497
01:24:59,605 --> 01:25:02,438
Bye, Idhaya.
May all your wishes come true.

1498
01:25:02,730 --> 01:25:04,313
I hope all your dreams come true.

1499
01:25:05,021 --> 01:25:06,021
All the best.

1500
01:25:07,438 --> 01:25:08,355
Take care, okay.

1501
01:25:09,355 --> 01:25:10,271
Bye, Idhaya!

1502
01:25:16,063 --> 01:25:16,980
Damn you!

1503
01:25:34,313 --> 01:25:36,313
Son, you could've told her.

1504
01:25:38,771 --> 01:25:40,271
I had a friend named Raja.

1505
01:25:40,980 --> 01:25:43,563
Just like you,
he was madly in love.

1506
01:25:44,188 --> 01:25:46,480
But he never proposed his love to her.

1507
01:25:48,188 --> 01:25:49,188
What happened to him?

1508
01:25:50,563 --> 01:25:51,771
It's a long story.

1509
01:25:52,146 --> 01:25:53,605
But in these 20 minutes,

1510
01:25:54,021 --> 01:25:56,063
you took me back 20 years.

1511
01:25:56,896 --> 01:25:57,813
Thanks!

1512
01:26:21,396 --> 01:26:23,563
<i>In life, everyone gets only one chance,</i>

1513
01:26:23,771 --> 01:26:26,563
<i>but my chance ended
at the railway station.</i>

1514
01:26:29,605 --> 01:26:30,771
What are you thinking about?

1515
01:26:31,438 --> 01:26:32,355
If I were you,

1516
01:26:33,438 --> 01:26:38,230
I'd wonder why I couldn't say
those three words.

1517
01:26:40,646 --> 01:26:42,355
You were so close to that girl.

1518
01:26:43,438 --> 01:26:44,480
You should've told her, man.

1519
01:26:46,563 --> 01:26:48,521
Expressing yourself is easy when
there are no emotional ties involved.

1520
01:26:49,646 --> 01:26:51,855
But it's difficult to speak your heart

1521
01:26:52,771 --> 01:26:53,688
to someone you love.

1522
01:26:54,480 --> 01:26:55,396
Right?

1523
01:27:01,021 --> 01:27:04,480
<i>Many people, like me, couldn't
bring themselves to confess their love.</i>

1524
01:27:04,813 --> 01:27:06,146
<i>We couldn't express our love.</i>

1525
01:27:06,355 --> 01:27:08,063
<i>Or give a reason, either.</i>

1526
01:27:08,313 --> 01:27:09,771
<i>Idhaya!</i>

1527
01:27:12,146 --> 01:27:13,980
<i>Some things remained only a dream, sir.</i>

1528
01:27:14,313 --> 01:27:15,980
<i>Had it become a reality,
it would've been wonderful.</i>

1529
01:27:16,105 --> 01:27:17,438
<i>But it never got fulfilled.</i>

1530
01:27:17,771 --> 01:27:21,521
<i>Similarly,
I never expressed my love for Amudha.</i>

1531
01:27:21,980 --> 01:27:25,063
<i>After that,
life took everyone on different paths.</i>

1532
01:27:25,855 --> 01:27:27,480
<i>A few bonds were made.</i>

1533
01:27:30,521 --> 01:27:32,063
<i>A few bonds were broken.</i>

1534
01:27:33,271 --> 01:27:35,146
<i>Life was running faster than ever.</i>

1535
01:27:35,646 --> 01:27:38,230
<i>When I looked back,
five years had gone by.</i>

1536
01:27:41,438 --> 01:27:44,771
{\an8}<i>I'm proud to say
that DTV is entering its fourth year.</i>

1537
01:27:44,896 --> 01:27:47,187
{\an8}<i>Many congratulations
and thank you to one and all.</i>

1538
01:27:47,188 --> 01:27:48,105
Guys!

1539
01:27:48,730 --> 01:27:50,313
It's time to celebrate!

1540
01:27:53,646 --> 01:27:56,854
On this joyous occasion,
I'd like to share a few thoughts.

1541
01:27:56,855 --> 01:28:00,563
The work you all have been
doing as a team, once I did it alone.

1542
01:28:00,730 --> 01:28:02,438
Installing cable TV in every house.

1543
01:28:02,605 --> 01:28:03,605
Collecting payments.

1544
01:28:03,730 --> 01:28:05,271
Hosting movie nights on a VCR.

1545
01:28:05,521 --> 01:28:08,063
Going from one roof top to another
to repair TV antennas.

1546
01:28:08,230 --> 01:28:09,313
In those days,

1547
01:28:09,521 --> 01:28:12,396
there was a person who helped me
monitor the clarity of the TV relay.

1548
01:28:12,688 --> 01:28:14,188
That's none other than my cute Idhaya.

1549
01:28:17,396 --> 01:28:20,146
On this joyous occasion,
I come bearing good news.

1550
01:28:20,438 --> 01:28:22,063
We were regional all these years.

1551
01:28:22,938 --> 01:28:25,104
Now we'll be participating
in the National Television race.

1552
01:28:25,105 --> 01:28:27,105
Now, let's give ourselves
a huge round of applause!

1553
01:28:30,105 --> 01:28:31,021
Thank you.

1554
01:28:31,938 --> 01:28:32,980
Congratulations, Boss!

1555
01:28:33,105 --> 01:28:34,021
Yes, my boy!

1556
01:28:35,480 --> 01:28:36,396
Let's celebrate.

1557
01:28:43,188 --> 01:28:44,521
Hi! How are you?

1558
01:28:44,646 --> 01:28:46,605
How come you're calling?
Do you still remember us?

1559
01:28:46,896 --> 01:28:49,062
Dude, this is too much!

1560
01:28:49,063 --> 01:28:50,938
Are you at a gym?

1561
01:28:51,105 --> 01:28:55,396
Yes! I nailed it
by losing 750 gms in three months.

1562
01:28:56,813 --> 01:28:58,479
It's been a long time
since I saw you smile.

1563
01:28:58,480 --> 01:29:00,145
Stay like this.
You should always be smiling.

1564
01:29:00,146 --> 01:29:01,520
- Wait, I'm adding others.
- Sure, add them.

1565
01:29:01,521 --> 01:29:02,813
- Hi!
- Hi!

1566
01:29:03,146 --> 01:29:04,730
- Hi, dude.
- Sachin bro!

1567
01:29:05,688 --> 01:29:07,854
- When is your wedding?
- Wedding, really?

1568
01:29:07,855 --> 01:29:09,354
How? How did you know?

1569
01:29:09,355 --> 01:29:10,688
Are you really getting married?

1570
01:29:10,855 --> 01:29:12,229
Hey, Dravid, how did you know?

1571
01:29:12,230 --> 01:29:14,396
Only two types of men go to the gym.

1572
01:29:14,563 --> 01:29:16,480
One who tries to fix himself
after a breakup.

1573
01:29:16,688 --> 01:29:17,895
Another who's getting married.

1574
01:29:17,896 --> 01:29:19,188
You belong to the second type.

1575
01:29:19,313 --> 01:29:21,188
Oh, please wait.
I'll connect Lado.

1576
01:29:21,480 --> 01:29:23,230
Hey! Don't do it!

1577
01:29:23,355 --> 01:29:24,688
Please take the phone away from her.

1578
01:29:24,813 --> 01:29:26,105
Guys, jokes apart.

1579
01:29:26,563 --> 01:29:28,438
Next month, on the 24th,
my wedding is in Madurai.

1580
01:29:28,688 --> 01:29:29,770
All of you are invited.

1581
01:29:29,771 --> 01:29:31,354
We're going to enjoy ourselves
and have fun!

1582
01:29:31,355 --> 01:29:32,771
- Fun it is.
- Oh, wait!

1583
01:29:33,021 --> 01:29:34,104
You never said who the girl is.

1584
01:29:34,105 --> 01:29:36,520
Shit! I forgot to mention.
Her name is Tulasi.

1585
01:29:36,521 --> 01:29:37,979
When you guys come down,
I'll introduce her.

1586
01:29:37,980 --> 01:29:39,063
- Sure!
- Tulasi?

1587
01:29:39,188 --> 01:29:40,813
- Okay, see you guys. Bye!
- Hey!

1588
01:29:40,938 --> 01:29:42,146
<i>Please wait!</i>

1589
01:29:42,438 --> 01:29:44,021
<i>Let's talk for a while.</i>

1590
01:29:44,271 --> 01:29:46,563
It's been a long time
since we laughed over a call.

1591
01:29:47,396 --> 01:29:48,313
You're right!

1592
01:29:49,188 --> 01:29:50,395
I, too, miss you guys a lot.

1593
01:29:50,396 --> 01:29:52,730
But aren't you guys staying
in the same building?

1594
01:29:52,855 --> 01:29:55,104
On different floors.
What are you both missing out on?

1595
01:29:55,105 --> 01:29:57,730
- You guys must be together all the time.
- Don't get me started.

1596
01:29:57,896 --> 01:30:01,145
Idhaya and I work in the same office. He's
on the 3rd floor, I'm on the 2nd floor.

1597
01:30:01,146 --> 01:30:03,730
- But it's been 3 weeks since I met him.
- Has it been 3 weeks?

1598
01:30:05,188 --> 01:30:07,521
What was the biggest issue
back then for us as students?

1599
01:30:07,938 --> 01:30:09,771
Lado and Sachin were on-and-off
in their relationship.

1600
01:30:10,230 --> 01:30:12,355
Idhaya had issues confessing his love.

1601
01:30:12,688 --> 01:30:14,980
And I had issues sneaking out to
meet him without my family knowing.

1602
01:30:15,188 --> 01:30:17,104
Okay! Don't get too emotional.

1603
01:30:17,105 --> 01:30:19,438
Come to Madurai,
we'll enjoy for four days.

1604
01:30:19,563 --> 01:30:20,896
We're going to enjoy!

1605
01:30:21,021 --> 01:30:22,938
<i>- Okay, guys, see you!
- Bye, Idhaya.</i>

1606
01:30:27,688 --> 01:30:32,355
<i>Butterflies… are fluttering</i>

1607
01:30:33,521 --> 01:30:37,938
<i>A game of hide-and-seek… is on</i>

1608
01:31:02,896 --> 01:31:08,687
<i>Don't keep those untold stories
Locked in your heart</i>

1609
01:31:08,688 --> 01:31:14,438
<i>Don't keep your passion trapped inside...</i>

1610
01:31:15,855 --> 01:31:18,645
Bro, if you don't wear the guard,
even God can't help you.

1611
01:31:18,646 --> 01:31:19,563
I ought to!

1612
01:31:20,230 --> 01:31:25,854
<i>Express the love in your eyes with words,
And it will blossom</i>

1613
01:31:25,855 --> 01:31:28,605
<i>Sorrows faded away</i>

1614
01:31:28,730 --> 01:31:31,355
<i>Even the colors celebrate us</i>

1615
01:31:31,521 --> 01:31:36,355
<i>My heart echoes your every word</i>

1616
01:31:37,188 --> 01:31:39,812
<i>Butterflies are fluttering</i>

1617
01:31:39,813 --> 01:31:42,480
<i>A game of hide-and-seek is on</i>

1618
01:31:42,605 --> 01:31:45,355
<i>Everything looks lush and green</i>

1619
01:31:45,646 --> 01:31:47,605
<i>Beautiful birds circle in our sight</i>

1620
01:31:50,813 --> 01:31:52,313
- Hello!
- Hello, son.

1621
01:31:52,646 --> 01:31:55,438
Hindu Religious and Charitable Endowments
Minister, Paranthaman speaking.

1622
01:31:55,563 --> 01:31:59,230
<i>There are a million ways
for a TV channel to trend in Tamil Nadu.</i>

1623
01:31:59,563 --> 01:32:01,270
Instead, you guys are always accusing me,

1624
01:32:01,271 --> 01:32:05,646
publishing bad news about me.
Which may infuriate my cadres.

1625
01:32:05,896 --> 01:32:07,938
Listen, I may be silent
and won't react to it.

1626
01:32:08,105 --> 01:32:09,646
But my cadres won't stay silent.

1627
01:32:09,813 --> 01:32:11,896
- So, I'm gently warning you.
- Thanks for your concern, sir.

1628
01:32:15,188 --> 01:32:16,105
{\an8}IDHAYA

1629
01:32:17,271 --> 01:32:19,188
{\an8}- Who are you waiting for?
- Arrow through the heart.

1630
01:32:19,646 --> 01:32:20,604
{\an8}That's me!

1631
01:32:20,605 --> 01:32:21,771
{\an8}- Nephew!
- Uncle!

1632
01:32:21,896 --> 01:32:22,895
Welcome!

1633
01:32:22,896 --> 01:32:24,854
Seeing the groom,
I thought his friends would be stout,

1634
01:32:24,855 --> 01:32:26,520
but you look fit, with a six-pack.

1635
01:32:26,521 --> 01:32:27,563
Oh, come on!

1636
01:32:28,563 --> 01:32:30,313
That's my niece in the back seat.

1637
01:32:30,438 --> 01:32:32,521
She wanted to get a SIM card,
so I brought her along.

1638
01:32:32,688 --> 01:32:34,355
Enough reactions.
Please get inside the car.

1639
01:32:40,105 --> 01:32:41,813
Take a look
at the Madurai Medical College.

1640
01:32:42,146 --> 01:32:43,063
Looks good.

1641
01:32:43,521 --> 01:32:44,980
They are very efficient.

1642
01:32:46,313 --> 01:32:48,021
You should not be on a diet
when you're in Madurai.

1643
01:32:48,188 --> 01:32:50,480
- You must eat your heart's content.
- I understand.

1644
01:32:51,521 --> 01:32:53,395
You've come to our
city for the first time.

1645
01:32:53,396 --> 01:32:55,021
Let's start by having <i>Jigarthanda</i>.

1646
01:32:55,230 --> 01:32:56,813
- Sure.
- Yes, you must have it.

1647
01:32:57,980 --> 01:32:59,312
It's harder to get off than getting in.

1648
01:32:59,313 --> 01:33:00,562
<i>We've arrived.
Where are you?</i>

1649
01:33:00,563 --> 01:33:02,354
First, hear me out.
Do you know who I just saw?

1650
01:33:02,355 --> 01:33:03,271
<i>Who?</i>

1651
01:33:30,146 --> 01:33:31,813
Hey, Idhaya?

1652
01:33:32,438 --> 01:33:33,938
- Yes!
- What are you doing over here?

1653
01:33:35,230 --> 01:33:37,146
- Samyuktha…
- Samantha.

1654
01:33:37,313 --> 01:33:39,646
Samantha, Hi. How are you?

1655
01:33:39,771 --> 01:33:40,771
I'm doing well.

1656
01:33:41,313 --> 01:33:42,938
It's been ages since I last saw you.

1657
01:33:43,230 --> 01:33:44,688
The last time was at the coaching class.

1658
01:33:44,855 --> 01:33:46,313
Now, we are settled in Chennai.

1659
01:33:46,480 --> 01:33:47,396
What brings you here?

1660
01:33:47,813 --> 01:33:49,229
What's with the formal addressing?

1661
01:33:49,230 --> 01:33:50,480
The bride is my cousin.

1662
01:33:50,855 --> 01:33:52,521
Wait! Where are your friends?

1663
01:33:52,646 --> 01:33:53,938
Everyone is on their way.

1664
01:33:54,396 --> 01:33:55,355
Nice, nice!

1665
01:33:56,230 --> 01:33:58,396
Sorry, I was on a work call.

1666
01:33:58,605 --> 01:33:59,771
That's why I didn't notice you.

1667
01:34:00,271 --> 01:34:02,146
That's okay.
In which IT company do you work?

1668
01:34:03,021 --> 01:34:04,105
IT company?

1669
01:34:05,771 --> 01:34:06,771
I work for NASA!

1670
01:34:07,230 --> 01:34:09,855
I work for NASA
in a space research program.

1671
01:34:10,230 --> 01:34:12,480
Oh, okay!
Space research, you say?

1672
01:34:13,521 --> 01:34:14,438
Yeah, in the space.

1673
01:34:15,396 --> 01:34:16,396
Like an astronaut?

1674
01:34:16,688 --> 01:34:18,021
Ah, yes.

1675
01:34:18,355 --> 01:34:21,396
Sometimes I work as a scientist
and sometimes as an engineer.

1676
01:34:21,730 --> 01:34:23,855
But right now we're starting
a new mission.

1677
01:34:24,646 --> 01:34:26,480
Wow! Nice!

1678
01:34:28,230 --> 01:34:30,813
- What about your twin sister?
- You mean, Samyuktha?

1679
01:34:31,063 --> 01:34:33,355
- Yeah, Samyuktha.
- She's married and settled in Australia.

1680
01:34:33,938 --> 01:34:36,230
Oh, you guys already know each other.

1681
01:34:36,563 --> 01:34:38,812
But I'm used to buying <i>Jigarthanda</i>,
whoever arrives in Madurai.

1682
01:34:38,813 --> 01:34:39,813
- Have it.
- Thanks.

1683
01:34:40,313 --> 01:34:42,020
- Thanks, Uncle.
- Always listening to music.

1684
01:34:42,021 --> 01:34:44,145
- Yes, tell me, bro!
<i>- Idhaya, did you land? Where are you?</i>

1685
01:34:44,146 --> 01:34:46,354
- Tell him we're at FAMOUS <i>Jigarthanda</i>.
- I'm here with your uncle.

1686
01:34:46,355 --> 01:34:47,813
<i>Step aside in private and talk.</i>

1687
01:34:48,521 --> 01:34:50,563
- Excuse me for a minute.
- Please go ahead.

1688
01:34:51,230 --> 01:34:52,146
What is it, bro?

1689
01:34:52,313 --> 01:34:54,229
<i>I invited Lado to the wedding by mistake.</i>

1690
01:34:54,230 --> 01:34:56,771
<i>She has come to create problems.
Now, I don't know what to do.</i>

1691
01:34:57,146 --> 01:34:58,979
- So what?
<i>- I can't send someone else to pick her.</i>

1692
01:34:58,980 --> 01:35:00,063
<i>Please go and pick her up.</i>

1693
01:35:00,188 --> 01:35:02,354
- Hey, don't drag me into this.
<i>- Dude, please help me.</i>

1694
01:35:02,355 --> 01:35:03,270
It won't work out.

1695
01:35:03,271 --> 01:35:06,021
<i>Please understand. It might
become a huge issue. If you bring her…</i>

1696
01:35:06,146 --> 01:35:08,645
<i>I'll manage by saying that
she came with you.</i>

1697
01:35:08,646 --> 01:35:10,104
<i>For God's sake, please bring her.</i>

1698
01:35:10,105 --> 01:35:11,520
- I can't, bro.
<i>- Please bring her. Bye!</i>

1699
01:35:11,521 --> 01:35:12,521
<i>- Bye-bye.</i>
- Hey!

1700
01:35:13,355 --> 01:35:14,604
Let's take them for lunch.

1701
01:35:14,605 --> 01:35:15,895
- Lunch, right?
- To the Pandian Hotel.

1702
01:35:15,896 --> 01:35:16,812
Let's make it a feast.

1703
01:35:16,813 --> 01:35:19,145
- Shall we make a move?
- No, I'm returning to the airport.

1704
01:35:19,146 --> 01:35:20,895
- Did you lose a bag?
- No, uncle.

1705
01:35:20,896 --> 01:35:22,104
An important friend is arriving.

1706
01:35:22,105 --> 01:35:23,438
- Friend?
- I must pick them up.

1707
01:35:23,771 --> 01:35:25,687
You guys go home. I'll take a cab.

1708
01:35:25,688 --> 01:35:28,062
Cab? Why trouble yourself
when we have a car?

1709
01:35:28,063 --> 01:35:29,395
Let's bring your friend along.

1710
01:35:29,396 --> 01:35:30,437
Let's go together.

1711
01:35:30,438 --> 01:35:32,104
It's okay, I can manage.

1712
01:35:32,105 --> 01:35:33,437
- Don't feel shy.
- Hey, come on.

1713
01:35:33,438 --> 01:35:35,271
We'll have the fish curry
on our way home.

1714
01:35:37,896 --> 01:35:40,063
- Shall I come along?
- No, I'll handle it.

1715
01:35:40,688 --> 01:35:42,271
Lado, what are you doing here?

1716
01:35:42,480 --> 01:35:44,355
Hey, Sachin is getting married.

1717
01:35:45,105 --> 01:35:47,313
Let me tell you something.
Sachin does not deserve you.

1718
01:35:47,563 --> 01:35:48,980
This is the truth. Understand?

1719
01:35:49,688 --> 01:35:52,271
I agree.
But Sachin is getting married.

1720
01:35:54,605 --> 01:35:55,563
- What happened?
- Lado.

1721
01:35:55,980 --> 01:35:58,271
Sachin's wife's relatives are in the car.

1722
01:35:58,605 --> 01:35:59,605
- Wife?
- Please be careful.

1723
01:35:59,980 --> 01:36:01,896
He's not yet married,
and you're already calling her his wife.

1724
01:36:02,021 --> 01:36:02,980
Then what should I call this?

1725
01:36:03,271 --> 01:36:05,937
Does it mean I'm his first wife?
Hello, we're not divorced yet.

1726
01:36:05,938 --> 01:36:07,687
- Excuse me, I have to say something.
- Please, Lado!

1727
01:36:07,688 --> 01:36:08,688
Sam, look over there.

1728
01:36:09,230 --> 01:36:11,020
Looks like they're head over heels
for each other.

1729
01:36:11,021 --> 01:36:13,229
The young couple wanted
to come in a cab for privacy.

1730
01:36:13,230 --> 01:36:14,688
But I spoiled it by barging in.

1731
01:36:14,813 --> 01:36:16,938
Please, please, please. Please, Lado.

1732
01:36:17,063 --> 01:36:18,563
Whatever it is, we'll discuss at home.

1733
01:36:18,938 --> 01:36:19,938
Okay, fine.

1734
01:36:20,605 --> 01:36:21,605
- Pick up my bag.
- Okay.

1735
01:36:22,605 --> 01:36:23,938
- Hold this as well.
- Hand it to me.

1736
01:36:24,105 --> 01:36:26,854
- Don't say anything, Lado.
- Okay, you shift to the front seat.

1737
01:36:26,855 --> 01:36:29,146
Let them take the back seat.
They might get offended.

1738
01:36:31,313 --> 01:36:33,313
How do you know the groom, Sachin?

1739
01:36:33,646 --> 01:36:34,937
He and I in college--

1740
01:36:34,938 --> 01:36:38,395
Uncle, we studied together in college.
That's how we became friends.

1741
01:36:38,396 --> 01:36:40,188
- Oh!
- Why aren't you letting me speak?

1742
01:36:40,355 --> 01:36:42,355
Listen, we'll go straight to the wedding,

1743
01:36:42,605 --> 01:36:44,437
then get back home and discuss further.

1744
01:36:44,438 --> 01:36:46,355
After that, we'll go back home.
Understand?

1745
01:36:46,938 --> 01:36:47,979
Did you notice, Sam?

1746
01:36:47,980 --> 01:36:51,395
I think they'll elope and get married
before Sachin gets married.

1747
01:36:51,396 --> 01:36:52,521
We must watch them carefully.

1748
01:37:02,521 --> 01:37:03,438
Wow!

1749
01:37:08,855 --> 01:37:10,270
Sam, why aren't you bringing the guests?

1750
01:37:10,271 --> 01:37:12,021
- You bring them, I have work.
- Fine, I'll do it.

1751
01:37:14,438 --> 01:37:16,021
- Hey, Idhaya!
- Hi, uncle.

1752
01:37:17,896 --> 01:37:19,813
- When did you arrive?
- I just arrived, Uncle.

1753
01:37:20,980 --> 01:37:21,980
Where's your son?

1754
01:37:25,063 --> 01:37:26,020
Okay.

1755
01:37:26,021 --> 01:37:28,604
- Why is she here?
- Not an issue. I'll handle her.

1756
01:37:28,605 --> 01:37:30,063
I'll handle her.
Don't worry about it.

1757
01:37:30,521 --> 01:37:31,479
Lado!

1758
01:37:31,480 --> 01:37:34,229
What do you mean? How could he
leave the lover who came to meet him?

1759
01:37:34,230 --> 01:37:36,396
Let's go inside. Always glaring at me.

1760
01:37:36,896 --> 01:37:38,229
Hey, Lado is coming.
How are we going to--

1761
01:37:38,230 --> 01:37:39,187
- Hi!
- Hi!

1762
01:37:39,188 --> 01:37:40,520
Hi, how are you people?

1763
01:37:40,521 --> 01:37:42,020
Where's Sachin? Is he inside?

1764
01:37:42,021 --> 01:37:43,770
- Hey, what's happening?
- Hey, not over there.

1765
01:37:43,771 --> 01:37:46,021
Wait, our room is over there.
Let's go and freshen up.

1766
01:37:46,855 --> 01:37:49,230
- Hey, Sachin's grandma.
- We'll meet her later.

1767
01:37:50,146 --> 01:37:53,105
- Where's the groom?
- He is in this room.

1768
01:37:54,855 --> 01:37:55,771
Dude!

1769
01:37:56,563 --> 01:37:57,480
How are you, bro?

1770
01:37:57,646 --> 01:37:59,146
- Excuse me!
- Carry on, son.

1771
01:38:00,896 --> 01:38:02,271
Why the hell did you invite Lado?

1772
01:38:02,438 --> 01:38:04,479
Dude, I called her when I was high.

1773
01:38:04,480 --> 01:38:07,104
I never expected her to show up
and cause problems.

1774
01:38:07,105 --> 01:38:09,396
Yeah, as if you're unaware of her traits.

1775
01:38:10,188 --> 01:38:11,896
People think she's my girlfriend.

1776
01:38:12,521 --> 01:38:15,313
Phew! So, I'm out of trouble then.

1777
01:38:15,480 --> 01:38:16,896
Why would it be an issue to you?

1778
01:38:18,355 --> 01:38:19,813
I don't exactly have an issue...

1779
01:38:31,813 --> 01:38:32,730
Dude!

1780
01:38:33,063 --> 01:38:35,105
Handle it for one day.
Tomorrow's my wedding.

1781
01:38:35,396 --> 01:38:37,313
Please manage Lado.

1782
01:38:38,730 --> 01:38:41,146
- I'll handle it, bro.
- Thank you, dude.

1783
01:38:44,480 --> 01:38:45,521
I'm so stressed!

1784
01:38:46,855 --> 01:38:48,813
I can't even get married in peace.

1785
01:38:49,021 --> 01:38:50,646
You should've thought about it
before you invited her.

1786
01:38:57,896 --> 01:38:59,188
Why the heck would they play this song?

1787
01:38:59,771 --> 01:39:01,188
Hey, it's our love anthem.

1788
01:39:01,313 --> 01:39:04,063
If she hears this…
She'll come down and torture me.

1789
01:39:05,021 --> 01:39:06,605
First, switch off this song.

1790
01:39:11,355 --> 01:39:14,979
Oh! So, everyone is happily gathered here.

1791
01:39:14,980 --> 01:39:16,896
But I've been crying like an idiot inside.

1792
01:39:17,438 --> 01:39:19,146
Wow!

1793
01:39:19,480 --> 01:39:21,021
The groom's charm is glowing on you.

1794
01:39:21,230 --> 01:39:23,813
New shirt, is it? Very nice!

1795
01:39:24,355 --> 01:39:25,271
Super!

1796
01:39:27,855 --> 01:39:30,230
Hi, Lado! How are you?

1797
01:39:31,313 --> 01:39:33,355
Look for yourself. Am I okay?

1798
01:39:34,480 --> 01:39:36,563
Look at my face.
Do I look okay?

1799
01:39:36,896 --> 01:39:37,813
You tell me.

1800
01:39:39,938 --> 01:39:42,313
What's your problem now?
What do you want?

1801
01:39:43,063 --> 01:39:45,646
Let's talk.
But first, call off the wedding.

1802
01:39:45,855 --> 01:39:48,105
Whatever it is, we'll sit down and talk.

1803
01:39:48,230 --> 01:39:50,020
- Okay. Please sit down.
- Are you kidding?

1804
01:39:50,021 --> 01:39:51,312
I'm not kidding. I'm serious.

1805
01:39:51,313 --> 01:39:52,312
- Let's talk.
- It's not a joke.

1806
01:39:52,313 --> 01:39:54,230
Please hear me out.
We'll sort this out.

1807
01:39:54,438 --> 01:39:55,479
Let's sit down and talk.

1808
01:39:55,480 --> 01:39:57,812
- Please call off the wedding.
- Lado, this is getting out of hand.

1809
01:39:57,813 --> 01:39:59,312
- Please wait, Idhaya.
- Let's go, Lado.

1810
01:39:59,313 --> 01:40:00,645
- Wait a minute.
- Please hear me out.

1811
01:40:00,646 --> 01:40:01,771
- Let me talk to him.
- No...

1812
01:40:01,938 --> 01:40:05,105
Idhaya, unlike you
I can't help but express my love.

1813
01:40:05,896 --> 01:40:07,021
I'll fight for my love!

1814
01:40:13,438 --> 01:40:14,355
Sit down.

1815
01:40:14,813 --> 01:40:17,146
Please sit down. Please!

1816
01:40:18,313 --> 01:40:20,355
Do you want me to marry you?

1817
01:40:21,605 --> 01:40:23,521
If I have to marry you…

1818
01:40:25,188 --> 01:40:26,188
Two families

1819
01:40:27,605 --> 01:40:29,980
are fast asleep with a wish that
the wedding is at the crack of dawn.

1820
01:40:31,313 --> 01:40:33,355
Do you want to ruin their wish
and get married?

1821
01:40:35,855 --> 01:40:36,730
Tell me, Lado.

1822
01:40:37,646 --> 01:40:39,980
I can understand.

1823
01:40:40,521 --> 01:40:42,355
I can understand
that you haven't moved on.

1824
01:40:42,771 --> 01:40:45,521
But Lado, please think about
the plight of the other girl.

1825
01:40:46,605 --> 01:40:48,688
If you still insist on us getting married…

1826
01:40:49,271 --> 01:40:50,188
I'm ready!

1827
01:40:50,355 --> 01:40:51,938
I'll do whatever you ask me to.

1828
01:40:53,271 --> 01:40:54,188
I will!

1829
01:40:55,438 --> 01:40:56,605
I respect you, Lado.

1830
01:40:57,896 --> 01:40:59,271
I really respect you.

1831
01:41:06,771 --> 01:41:07,730
Lado.

1832
01:41:09,771 --> 01:41:10,688
Lado!

1833
01:41:13,105 --> 01:41:15,688
In the future, I hope you won't
blackmail me with pictures.

1834
01:41:18,146 --> 01:41:19,520
Pig! What did you say?

1835
01:41:19,521 --> 01:41:20,896
What did you say?

1836
01:41:21,396 --> 01:41:22,605
You ditched me, dude.

1837
01:41:22,813 --> 01:41:25,020
I'm going to get married
to a better guy than you.

1838
01:41:25,021 --> 01:41:27,313
Someone like Mahesh Babu.
Look at yourself, though.

1839
01:41:33,188 --> 01:41:35,229
So, that means Lado
is not your girlfriend.

1840
01:41:35,230 --> 01:41:36,313
Nah, she's my friend.

1841
01:41:48,271 --> 01:41:50,396
<i>O dainty little parrot
Wrapped in a sari</i>

1842
01:41:50,646 --> 01:41:52,813
<i>O slender vine
Adorned with a garland</i>

1843
01:41:53,063 --> 01:41:55,021
<i>You're such a rare beauty
That any groom would be captivated</i>

1844
01:41:55,230 --> 01:41:57,437
<i>Just one look at you,
And a melody springs to life</i>

1845
01:41:57,438 --> 01:42:01,645
<i>You've descended like an angel
Just fold your wings</i>

1846
01:42:01,646 --> 01:42:05,937
<i>Let's stand by each other
For a lifetime</i>

1847
01:42:05,938 --> 01:42:10,354
<i>Your cheeks are flushed with a deep,
Timeless crimson</i>

1848
01:42:10,355 --> 01:42:14,730
<i>Your forehead shines with the deep,
Enduring red of kumkum</i>

1849
01:42:14,980 --> 01:42:19,230
<i>Our girl is quite a handful
She won't let anyone have it easy</i>

1850
01:42:19,438 --> 01:42:23,605
<i>Our boy is a gem,
So cherish and protect him</i>

1851
01:42:23,771 --> 01:42:27,896
<i>She walks in, radiant as jasmine
And magical in her bridal finery</i>

1852
01:42:28,105 --> 01:42:30,688
<i>Wherever she sets foot, flowers blossom</i>

1853
01:42:30,813 --> 01:42:32,938
<i>She's the little darling
Everyone praises</i>

1854
01:42:33,271 --> 01:42:37,105
<i>My darling, my treasure
You are as soothing as sandalwood</i>

1855
01:42:37,313 --> 01:42:41,521
<i>Your very being drips with sweetness
You're a bundle of beauty</i>

1856
01:42:42,146 --> 01:42:46,229
<i>My golden one,
Just wait until night falls</i>

1857
01:42:46,230 --> 01:42:50,521
<i>Even a lion turns into a little mouse,
Circling only around you</i>

1858
01:43:26,646 --> 01:43:30,896
<i>I'll give you every star in the sky</i>

1859
01:43:31,021 --> 01:43:35,437
<i>Give me that forelock
That grazes your brow</i>

1860
01:43:35,438 --> 01:43:39,813
<i>Even all the care you show me
Can never satisfy my longing</i>

1861
01:43:39,980 --> 01:43:44,188
<i>She stands beside me,
Grazing me like royalty</i>

1862
01:43:44,438 --> 01:43:46,355
<i>You bewitching beauty</i>

1863
01:43:46,605 --> 01:43:48,730
<i>Your smile leaves me love-struck</i>

1864
01:43:48,896 --> 01:43:53,021
<i>You're as sweet as a laddu,
Covered in beauty spots</i>

1865
01:43:53,313 --> 01:43:57,230
<i>My darling, my treasure
You are as soothing as sandalwood</i>

1866
01:43:57,396 --> 01:44:01,605
<i>Your very being drips with sweetness
You're a bundle of beauty</i>

1867
01:44:02,146 --> 01:44:06,187
<i>My golden one,
Just wait until night falls</i>

1868
01:44:06,188 --> 01:44:10,438
<i>Even a lion turns into a little mouse,
Circling only around you</i>

1869
01:44:50,855 --> 01:44:53,021
Look at this handsome boy.

1870
01:44:53,480 --> 01:44:55,687
Where are you going, son?

1871
01:44:55,688 --> 01:44:58,645
- Stand in one place.
- My dear boy.

1872
01:44:58,646 --> 01:44:59,645
What happened?

1873
01:44:59,646 --> 01:45:01,521
Such a beautiful boy.

1874
01:45:02,938 --> 01:45:03,855
Come!

1875
01:45:05,271 --> 01:45:07,605
What happened?
Where are you going?

1876
01:45:09,396 --> 01:45:12,313
Remember the <i>pani puri</i> shop
next to the coaching class?

1877
01:45:14,271 --> 01:45:15,521
Yeah, I remember.

1878
01:45:16,396 --> 01:45:18,271
I feel like having their <i>pani puri</i>.

1879
01:45:20,605 --> 01:45:22,605
Who would go all the way to Trichy
just to have <i>pani puri</i>?

1880
01:45:23,563 --> 01:45:24,480
I will go!

1881
01:45:24,938 --> 01:45:25,896
Ah, sorry!

1882
01:45:28,188 --> 01:45:30,563
Idhaya, if you see anyone coming,
give me a signal.

1883
01:45:30,688 --> 01:45:31,605
Okay.

1884
01:45:39,188 --> 01:45:40,105
Sam!

1885
01:45:41,188 --> 01:45:42,771
I too feel like having <i>pani puri</i>.

1886
01:45:53,438 --> 01:45:55,104
- Hi, brother, how are you?
- I'm good.

1887
01:45:55,105 --> 01:45:56,896
- Your shop looks different now.
- Yes, son.

1888
01:46:03,605 --> 01:46:07,062
- Super!
- I thought you said two would be enough.

1889
01:46:07,063 --> 01:46:08,729
Sriram, why did you
join the coaching class?

1890
01:46:08,730 --> 01:46:09,895
Aren't you here for Pradeepa?

1891
01:46:09,896 --> 01:46:13,271
The classes will end in two weeks.
When will you tell her?

1892
01:46:22,313 --> 01:46:24,605
<i>Oh, baby,
You be taking my breath away</i>

1893
01:46:25,021 --> 01:46:27,771
<i>Hey, come on, come here</i>

1894
01:46:28,146 --> 01:46:29,938
<i>I'll keep knockin' your door</i>

1895
01:46:30,771 --> 01:46:32,729
<i>Are you the gift fate gave me?</i>

1896
01:46:32,730 --> 01:46:34,813
<i>Oh, baby,
You be taking my breath away</i>

1897
01:46:35,230 --> 01:46:37,396
<i>Hey, come on, come here</i>

1898
01:46:37,563 --> 01:46:40,105
<i>Until I really feel
The thrill of first love</i>

1899
01:46:41,021 --> 01:46:43,146
<i>Are you the gift fate gave me?</i>

1900
01:46:44,896 --> 01:46:45,896
What are you looking for?

1901
01:46:46,563 --> 01:46:48,021
I had carved my name.

1902
01:46:48,938 --> 01:46:51,063
- Was that your bench?
- Yes.

1903
01:47:07,855 --> 01:47:09,188
You get up.

1904
01:47:10,355 --> 01:47:11,813
Yeah, you! Stand up!

1905
01:47:12,313 --> 01:47:13,230
Get up! Get up!

1906
01:47:14,646 --> 01:47:15,937
State Newton's second law.

1907
01:47:15,938 --> 01:47:19,063
Acceleration of an object
is directly proportional to its net force.

1908
01:47:19,188 --> 01:47:22,187
F=ma

1909
01:47:22,188 --> 01:47:23,771
How come you still remember it?

1910
01:47:24,938 --> 01:47:27,271
I studied hard.
How could I forget?

1911
01:47:37,855 --> 01:47:39,646
I didn't know you liked <i>pani puri</i> so much.

1912
01:47:40,021 --> 01:47:43,355
Come to Chennai. I'll take you
to Sowcarpet and buy you lots of it.

1913
01:47:44,188 --> 01:47:45,146
<i>Pani puri?</i>

1914
01:47:46,605 --> 01:47:47,771
I have a flight to catch tomorrow.

1915
01:47:48,355 --> 01:47:49,313
I'm heading back to the US.

1916
01:47:50,480 --> 01:47:52,771
- Not sure when I'll return.
- Tomorrow?

1917
01:47:53,063 --> 01:47:53,980
Yeah!

1918
01:47:56,521 --> 01:47:59,396
Hey, wait.
There are missed calls from Dad.

1919
01:48:15,355 --> 01:48:17,396
Idhaya, it's getting late.
Let's go!

1920
01:48:28,688 --> 01:48:31,313
<i>- Hey, groomsmen, where are you guys?</i>
- We're at the office. You?

1921
01:48:31,688 --> 01:48:32,687
<i>I'm at the Chennai airport.</i>

1922
01:48:32,688 --> 01:48:34,605
Why are you always at an airport?

1923
01:48:34,771 --> 01:48:37,270
<i>Stop kidding.
Sam is leaving for America.</i>

1924
01:48:37,271 --> 01:48:38,770
<i>So we came to send her off.</i>

1925
01:48:38,771 --> 01:48:41,396
You own a THAR SUV,
but you're driving it like a cab.

1926
01:48:41,688 --> 01:48:43,229
After dropping her off,
come to the office.

1927
01:48:43,230 --> 01:48:44,188
<i>Sure!</i>

1928
01:48:47,980 --> 01:48:49,646
- I want to go to the airport.
- Why airport?

1929
01:48:49,855 --> 01:48:51,896
Brother said he will come here.
Why should we go?

1930
01:48:55,146 --> 01:48:56,771
- I'm in love with Sam.
- Hey!

1931
01:48:57,230 --> 01:48:59,563
- Why suddenly?
- It's not sudden!

1932
01:49:00,230 --> 01:49:02,855
Why would I meet her and hang out
in Madurai after so many years?

1933
01:49:05,438 --> 01:49:07,313
Everything in life happens for a reason.

1934
01:49:09,688 --> 01:49:10,855
If I miss this chance…

1935
01:49:11,563 --> 01:49:13,813
I don't think
I will get another chance to tell her.

1936
01:49:14,396 --> 01:49:15,813
That's not what I meant.
But all of a sudden…

1937
01:49:17,688 --> 01:49:19,646
I cannot repeat the same mistake.

1938
01:49:22,271 --> 01:49:24,520
- Hey, we're coming along.
- Dude, wait for us.

1939
01:49:24,521 --> 01:49:25,896
Check how long until the flight leaves.

1940
01:49:27,271 --> 01:49:29,063
There's an hour left.

1941
01:49:31,021 --> 01:49:32,646
Hey, will you surely propose to her?

1942
01:49:34,646 --> 01:49:35,646
I will propose to her.

1943
01:49:35,771 --> 01:49:37,521
We have an hour left.
We'll arrive on time.

1944
01:49:37,646 --> 01:49:39,020
Sir, there's so much space here.

1945
01:49:39,021 --> 01:49:41,645
You could walk on the side. Why are you
shoving me? Which office do you work in?

1946
01:49:41,646 --> 01:49:44,188
Hey! There are many leaders
and politicians in the city.

1947
01:49:44,355 --> 01:49:47,104
You spare them all
but you're publishing news about my Chief.

1948
01:49:47,105 --> 01:49:48,020
Hey! I ought to!

1949
01:49:48,021 --> 01:49:49,855
What a timing. Oh, no!

1950
01:49:50,105 --> 01:49:51,480
Sir, I'm sorry.

1951
01:49:51,730 --> 01:49:52,730
I know who sent you.

1952
01:49:52,855 --> 01:49:55,687
I'm aware of why you are here.
But I'm urgently heading to the airport.

1953
01:49:55,688 --> 01:49:57,105
I'll be back in two hours.
Then, we'll discuss it.

1954
01:49:57,230 --> 01:49:58,145
Why don't you wait upstairs?

1955
01:49:58,146 --> 01:50:00,520
Hey, do we look like an auto
or taxi to put us on wait?

1956
01:50:00,521 --> 01:50:01,604
Sir, just give me two hours.

1957
01:50:01,605 --> 01:50:03,063
Hey, I want justice for my chief!

1958
01:50:03,313 --> 01:50:04,729
Sir, please go upstairs and sit.

1959
01:50:04,730 --> 01:50:06,395
Hey, what's your problem?

1960
01:50:06,396 --> 01:50:08,146
Excuse me,
how do I get to Accenture office?

1961
01:50:08,355 --> 01:50:09,396
- Sir, one minute.
- Hey!

1962
01:50:09,521 --> 01:50:10,937
- Hey!
- Accenture isn't here.

1963
01:50:10,938 --> 01:50:12,813
- You must head to that side.
- Not that side. But this side.

1964
01:50:12,980 --> 01:50:14,645
How is it even on this side?

1965
01:50:14,646 --> 01:50:16,312
- Sir, which way did you enter?
- Hey, hop in!

1966
01:50:16,313 --> 01:50:19,145
- Hop in, damn it!
- Hey, don't let them escape.

1967
01:50:19,146 --> 01:50:20,687
Hey, stop! Catch him!

1968
01:50:20,688 --> 01:50:21,896
Hey, start the car!

1969
01:50:25,730 --> 01:50:26,646
Catch him!

1970
01:50:37,438 --> 01:50:39,812
Hey, don't you have any road sense?

1971
01:50:39,813 --> 01:50:40,729
Step out of the car.

1972
01:50:40,730 --> 01:50:42,104
- Sir, sir, sir, sorry, sir.
- Step out of the car.

1973
01:50:42,105 --> 01:50:43,020
Sir, I'm sorry.

1974
01:50:43,021 --> 01:50:44,395
- Look, what have you done?
- Dude, you handle it.

1975
01:50:44,396 --> 01:50:46,145
- Go, catch them.
- Prabhu, you handle it.

1976
01:50:46,146 --> 01:50:47,604
Guys, you leave. I'll handle it.

1977
01:50:47,605 --> 01:50:48,521
Fine, handle him.

1978
01:50:48,813 --> 01:50:50,438
Look at yourself. Stop, damn it!

1979
01:50:50,813 --> 01:50:52,105
Hey, where are you going?
Stop!

1980
01:51:02,688 --> 01:51:04,355
Hey, how did you get in?

1981
01:51:04,605 --> 01:51:06,313
- Brother, is the bus going to the airport?
- Yes!

1982
01:51:06,521 --> 01:51:07,479
Take your seat.

1983
01:51:07,480 --> 01:51:08,938
- Super!
- Hey, who are you guys?

1984
01:51:09,313 --> 01:51:11,145
I'm a Shardul Thakur fan.

1985
01:51:11,146 --> 01:51:13,229
- Yes!
- Does he even have fans?

1986
01:51:13,230 --> 01:51:14,270
CSK runs in my blood.

1987
01:51:14,271 --> 01:51:16,354
If you slit his hands
he will bleed yellow.

1988
01:51:16,355 --> 01:51:19,020
Hey, you guys step off the bus
and do whatever you want.

1989
01:51:19,021 --> 01:51:21,021
Step off the bus
or else they'll fire me.

1990
01:51:21,188 --> 01:51:22,855
Brother, you'd only lose your job.

1991
01:51:22,980 --> 01:51:24,354
But my friend would lose his life.

1992
01:51:24,355 --> 01:51:25,521
It's a matter of love.

1993
01:51:25,730 --> 01:51:26,646
Love?

1994
01:51:44,855 --> 01:51:46,604
Hey, who's kissing the bonnet?

1995
01:51:46,605 --> 01:51:47,521
- Mumbai Indians, bro.
- Hey!

1996
01:51:48,063 --> 01:51:49,730
- Brother, eyes on the road!
- Oh, no!

1997
01:52:13,063 --> 01:52:15,437
Sir, he's a CSK fan.
Please spare him.

1998
01:52:15,438 --> 01:52:18,145
Hey, you proved
that you're a Shardul Thakur fan.

1999
01:52:18,146 --> 01:52:20,438
- You're getting thrashed.
- Please drive faster.

2000
01:52:49,105 --> 01:52:53,063
Hey, he's hanging like garlands
on a pilgrimage bus.

2001
01:53:07,230 --> 01:53:08,146
That's enough.

2002
01:53:11,938 --> 01:53:12,980
- Happy journey.
- Thank you.

2003
01:53:14,563 --> 01:53:17,896
Brother, he curled up
after getting thrashed by us.

2004
01:53:18,021 --> 01:53:19,438
Where do I bring him?

2005
01:53:37,355 --> 01:53:39,563
Hey, lift him.

2006
01:53:52,021 --> 01:53:54,188
CSK may be at the bottom
of the point table.

2007
01:53:54,313 --> 01:53:57,521
But suddenly, it'll shift to top gear
and move up.

2008
01:54:06,271 --> 01:54:07,687
Hey, we've arrived at the airport.

2009
01:54:07,688 --> 01:54:09,105
When are you going to finish the game?

2010
01:54:09,355 --> 01:54:11,438
Wait! Let me end it right away.

2011
01:54:13,146 --> 01:54:15,395
They already thrashed
and stuck him to the bonnet.

2012
01:54:15,396 --> 01:54:16,605
Yet he's determined to fight.

2013
01:54:26,855 --> 01:54:27,771
Stop it!

2014
01:54:28,063 --> 01:54:28,980
Buddy!

2015
01:54:29,938 --> 01:54:31,813
Stop it! You might kill him.

2016
01:54:32,688 --> 01:54:34,105
We're getting late for the flight.

2017
01:54:34,896 --> 01:54:36,770
They tore the bus seats.
I'm going to get fired.

2018
01:54:36,771 --> 01:54:37,979
I don't know what to do.

2019
01:54:37,980 --> 01:54:39,520
Hey, no, no!

2020
01:54:39,521 --> 01:54:42,105
Please don't record and post reels.
They'll fire me.

2021
01:54:52,188 --> 01:54:55,605
<i>Time came to a standstill</i>

2022
01:54:55,813 --> 01:54:58,396
<i>We've been stealing glances every day</i>

2023
01:54:58,563 --> 01:55:03,521
<i>My steps always find their way to you</i>

2024
01:55:03,980 --> 01:55:06,646
<i>Sleep has deserted me</i>

2025
01:55:06,813 --> 01:55:09,937
<i>My yearning keeps growing</i>

2026
01:55:09,938 --> 01:55:14,063
<i>My body trembles because of you,
My love</i>

2027
01:55:14,188 --> 01:55:16,980
<i>Hey, come on, come here</i>

2028
01:55:17,146 --> 01:55:19,771
<i>Are you the gift fate gave me?</i>

2029
01:55:19,938 --> 01:55:25,063
<i>Just your thoughts
Lift me off the ground</i>

2030
01:55:25,355 --> 01:55:28,021
<i>Just you… only you…</i>

2031
01:55:28,188 --> 01:55:30,855
<i>I'll stay by your side forever</i>

2032
01:55:30,980 --> 01:55:36,563
<i>You smile every day
Till your lips hurt</i>

2033
01:55:36,688 --> 01:55:39,563
<i>Oh, baby, you be taking my breath away
Pushing me far away</i>

2034
01:55:39,771 --> 01:55:42,687
<i>Making me drift away
Teasing me every day</i>

2035
01:55:42,688 --> 01:55:44,521
<i>I'll keep knockin' your door</i>

2036
01:55:45,646 --> 01:55:46,563
Hey, hey, hey, hey!

2037
01:55:47,771 --> 01:55:50,813
Idhaya, what are you doing?

2038
01:55:51,896 --> 01:55:56,730
<i>An unspoken love, raging within</i>

2039
01:55:57,438 --> 01:56:02,230
<i>An endless quest,
A heart filled with unrest</i>

2040
01:56:02,938 --> 01:56:07,688
<i>Will this wound ever heal
If we stay silent?</i>

2041
01:56:08,521 --> 01:56:13,521
<i>Will I overcome my shyness?
Will love prevail?</i>

2042
01:56:17,605 --> 01:56:21,271
<i>I'm still clueless about why
I ran onto the runway like a madman.</i>

2043
01:56:21,938 --> 01:56:24,188
<i>Perhaps I didn't want
to miss another opportunity with her.</i>

2044
01:56:24,730 --> 01:56:28,146
<i>But one good thing that came out of it
was that Juju came back into my life.</i>

2045
01:56:28,688 --> 01:56:31,396
<i>I thought my feelings for her
ended after that.</i>

2046
01:56:32,063 --> 01:56:34,813
<i>After that, back to square one.</i>

2047
01:56:36,271 --> 01:56:38,688
<i>My uncle was afraid
I would end up alone like him.</i>

2048
01:56:38,896 --> 01:56:41,480
<i>That's why he kept
insisting that I get married.</i>

2049
01:56:46,355 --> 01:56:47,313
<i>But then one day…</i>

2050
01:56:47,646 --> 01:56:49,605
{\an8}<i>I realized that she was beyond my reach.</i>

2051
01:56:54,938 --> 01:56:56,146
Hey, hey, hey, stop it!

2052
01:56:56,438 --> 01:56:58,021
Stop it! I am done!

2053
01:56:58,605 --> 01:57:01,438
- He's never going to propose.
- Sir, where are you going?

2054
01:57:01,730 --> 01:57:02,646
What do you expect?

2055
01:57:02,980 --> 01:57:05,021
I've been waiting for him
to propose at least once,

2056
01:57:05,188 --> 01:57:06,271
but he is not doing it.

2057
01:57:06,605 --> 01:57:07,521
Thrash him, sir.

2058
01:57:08,063 --> 01:57:10,980
Sir, you made it till here.
Please listen to the rest of the story.

2059
01:57:11,146 --> 01:57:12,063
It'll be terrific!

2060
01:57:12,605 --> 01:57:13,521
Another love?

2061
01:57:14,105 --> 01:57:15,770
- I can't bear it anymore. Spare me.
- Please, sir.

2062
01:57:15,771 --> 01:57:17,520
Sir, it's not another love story.

2063
01:57:17,521 --> 01:57:18,896
- He's getting engaged.
- Yes, sir.

2064
01:57:19,271 --> 01:57:21,563
- Engagement? Engagement?
- Yes, sir.

2065
01:57:21,938 --> 01:57:23,021
You never mentioned it.

2066
01:57:23,896 --> 01:57:27,395
I was expecting another tragedy
like the film <i>Punnagai Mannan</i>.

2067
01:57:27,396 --> 01:57:29,063
- Girl, please make me a drink.
- Plus one!

2068
01:57:30,813 --> 01:57:32,645
{\an8}<i>We all convinced him somehow.</i>

2069
01:57:32,646 --> 01:57:35,895
{\an8}<i>As per Uncle's wish,
we got him engaged to Adhithi.</i>

2070
01:57:35,896 --> 01:57:37,855
<i>He too accepted it and moved on.</i>

2071
01:58:03,313 --> 01:58:04,313
Hey, stop it!

2072
01:58:05,688 --> 01:58:07,520
Hey, at least wear shades
before checking girls out.

2073
01:58:07,521 --> 01:58:08,896
- It's so evident you're looking.
- Is it?

2074
01:58:09,146 --> 01:58:11,146
Here you go.
Where's your wife?

2075
01:58:11,730 --> 01:58:13,437
She's putting on makeup.

2076
01:58:13,438 --> 01:58:15,813
The engagement is over.
What is she getting ready for now?

2077
01:58:16,188 --> 01:58:17,687
Let her take her sweet time.
Let it go.

2078
01:58:17,688 --> 01:58:18,688
Sounds good!

2079
01:58:19,105 --> 01:58:22,063
I am confused if he's happy or sad.

2080
01:58:22,271 --> 01:58:24,688
He keeps an expression that
fits all kinds of background scores.

2081
01:58:25,271 --> 01:58:26,521
- Something is wrong.
- Hey...

2082
01:58:26,646 --> 01:58:29,271
He's doing well. Don't mess it up.

2083
01:58:29,605 --> 01:58:31,896
- I feel something's wrong.
- I too feel the same.

2084
01:58:32,105 --> 01:58:33,063
Let's ask him.

2085
01:58:35,021 --> 01:58:36,646
Hey, all okay?

2086
01:58:37,605 --> 01:58:38,605
Yeah, all okay.

2087
01:58:39,021 --> 01:58:40,021
All okay, it seems.

2088
01:58:40,230 --> 01:58:42,312
He's fine.
But you guys are confusing him.

2089
01:58:42,313 --> 01:58:43,313
What's the secret?

2090
01:58:43,771 --> 01:58:46,480
You see, a lot of your friends
have come down from Bangalore.

2091
01:58:46,605 --> 01:58:48,771
We're friends. They're friends, too.

2092
01:58:48,896 --> 01:58:50,979
If all the friends mingle…

2093
01:58:50,980 --> 01:58:52,645
I hope you understood.

2094
01:58:52,646 --> 01:58:54,980
But aren't you married?

2095
01:58:55,355 --> 01:58:57,020
He got married.
I never got married.

2096
01:58:57,021 --> 01:58:58,021
We two are bachelors!

2097
01:58:58,146 --> 01:58:59,729
- They are both single.
- Idhaya, please tell her.

2098
01:58:59,730 --> 01:59:00,855
They aren't married.

2099
01:59:00,980 --> 01:59:02,355
I only got married once.

2100
01:59:07,938 --> 01:59:09,104
<i>- Hey, Idhaya!</i>
- Hi, Adhithi.

2101
01:59:09,105 --> 01:59:10,521
<i>- Have you reached?</i>
- I reached.

2102
01:59:10,771 --> 01:59:12,645
<i>- Where exactly are you?</i>
- I'm right here. Where are you?

2103
01:59:12,646 --> 01:59:13,770
<i>I'm just parking my car.</i>

2104
01:59:13,771 --> 01:59:15,270
<i>- You?</i>
- I'm on the first floor.

2105
01:59:15,271 --> 01:59:16,354
<i>Super, I'll see you there.</i>

2106
01:59:16,355 --> 01:59:17,271
Idhaya!

2107
01:59:41,230 --> 01:59:42,480
What a surprise!

2108
01:59:43,646 --> 01:59:45,271
It's been years
since we last saw each other.

2109
01:59:49,730 --> 01:59:50,646
How are you?

2110
01:59:52,021 --> 01:59:53,438
Oh, my God! Look at you.

2111
01:59:53,605 --> 01:59:54,938
You've changed a lot, Idhaya.

2112
01:59:55,605 --> 01:59:57,230
Are you still in touch
with your college friends?

2113
01:59:57,563 --> 01:59:59,938
Sachin, Lado, Prabhu, Dravid…

2114
02:00:00,271 --> 02:00:02,438
Those days were a lot of fun.

2115
02:00:03,563 --> 02:00:05,480
Sorry, I couldn't keep in touch.

2116
02:00:06,021 --> 02:00:07,188
I miss those days.

2117
02:00:08,188 --> 02:00:09,146
How are you?

2118
02:00:09,813 --> 02:00:10,812
I'm doing well.

2119
02:00:10,813 --> 02:00:12,146
I now work at Delhi AIMS.

2120
02:00:12,271 --> 02:00:13,938
I came to Chennai to attend a conference.

2121
02:00:15,646 --> 02:00:18,146
I never expected to run into you.

2122
02:00:21,105 --> 02:00:22,396
Did you get married?

2123
02:00:23,521 --> 02:00:25,230
Not yet. But going to.

2124
02:00:27,146 --> 02:00:28,563
You haven't changed, Idhaya.

2125
02:00:29,230 --> 02:00:30,313
You're still the same.

2126
02:00:30,646 --> 02:00:32,396
A man of few words. Silent.

2127
02:00:32,605 --> 02:00:33,521
You're the same!

2128
02:00:37,896 --> 02:00:40,063
Anyway, I'm leaving.

2129
02:00:41,188 --> 02:00:42,105
I'll see you.

2130
02:00:42,813 --> 02:00:43,730
Bye.

2131
02:01:09,896 --> 02:01:13,146
If you don't mind,
I want to tell you something.

2132
02:01:15,730 --> 02:01:17,521
Back in college…

2133
02:01:19,396 --> 02:01:20,688
I was in love with you.

2134
02:01:25,188 --> 02:01:28,605
But I didn't know
if you felt the same way about me.

2135
02:01:29,146 --> 02:01:32,688
With the fear of rejection,
I could not confess my love.

2136
02:01:39,313 --> 02:01:41,813
<i>I was planning to tell you
at the railway station.</i>

2137
02:01:41,938 --> 02:01:43,271
<i>But I couldn't do it.</i>

2138
02:02:07,855 --> 02:02:08,771
But now…

2139
02:02:10,313 --> 02:02:11,730
I feel very happy.

2140
02:02:16,271 --> 02:02:17,438
Don't get me wrong.

2141
02:02:19,021 --> 02:02:20,188
I'm happily married.

2142
02:02:20,688 --> 02:02:22,313
I have two beautiful kids.

2143
02:02:23,980 --> 02:02:25,063
It's just that…

2144
02:02:27,480 --> 02:02:29,146
I felt like telling you.

2145
02:02:33,063 --> 02:02:34,438
And I'm glad I could.

2146
02:02:37,313 --> 02:02:38,146
I'm okay!

2147
02:02:38,771 --> 02:02:39,688
Bye!

2148
02:02:40,230 --> 02:02:43,980
Please don't forget to invite me
for your wedding.

2149
02:02:51,021 --> 02:02:53,188
Fine! Bye, Idhaya.

2150
02:02:54,146 --> 02:02:55,063
Bye!

2151
02:03:19,355 --> 02:03:20,646
{\an8}- <i>Hello?
- Lado, listen.</i>

2152
02:03:21,021 --> 02:03:22,438
<i>I'm coming to the US to meet Sam.</i>

2153
02:03:22,563 --> 02:03:23,895
Are you even in your senses?

2154
02:03:23,896 --> 02:03:26,105
You're about to get married.
Why would you do something like this?

2155
02:03:27,063 --> 02:03:31,271
The pain of rejection is nothing compared
to the pain of leaving your love unspoken.

2156
02:03:31,813 --> 02:03:34,105
Didn't you say that you
got to fight for your love?

2157
02:03:34,605 --> 02:03:36,438
I'm not in a situation to fight.

2158
02:03:37,605 --> 02:03:39,146
Even if I did,
it won't be the right thing to do.

2159
02:03:39,355 --> 02:03:41,688
At least let me speak my heart out.

2160
02:03:42,896 --> 02:03:45,979
Are you going to say
"you loved her" or "in love with her?"

2161
02:03:45,980 --> 02:03:48,020
Why are you asking me?
Ask Adhithi's family about it.

2162
02:03:48,021 --> 02:03:50,563
Call her father.
Instead, you're calling me.

2163
02:03:50,855 --> 02:03:52,896
Hey, I asked you a question.

2164
02:03:57,855 --> 02:03:59,688
- Hey, Senthil, come here.
<i>- Hey, are you there?</i>

2165
02:03:59,813 --> 02:04:00,730
<i>Hello?</i>

2166
02:04:01,271 --> 02:04:02,355
I'm going to say, "I loved her."

2167
02:04:02,938 --> 02:04:04,146
She's now my past, Lado.

2168
02:04:05,813 --> 02:04:09,271
If you think you'd feel better
after speaking your heart out,

2169
02:04:10,313 --> 02:04:11,980
then come over here.
We'll handle it.

2170
02:04:12,355 --> 02:04:13,271
Now, you say?

2171
02:04:13,480 --> 02:04:16,355
No! Get married to Adhithi
and bring her too.

2172
02:04:16,521 --> 02:04:17,979
Then you can tell her
"love you" together.

2173
02:04:17,980 --> 02:04:18,896
Come soon!

2174
02:04:20,063 --> 02:04:22,230
The wedding is in 10 days.
What excuse can I make?

2175
02:04:23,105 --> 02:04:25,646
You have your bachelor party.
Use that as an excuse.

2176
02:04:25,813 --> 02:04:27,396
Everyone will be
more than happy to come along.

2177
02:04:27,563 --> 02:04:29,563
I will handle the rest.
You just come.

2178
02:04:56,688 --> 02:04:59,104
Hey, don't make strong drinks
and get him sloshed.

2179
02:04:59,105 --> 02:05:01,855
- We have a lot of work to do.
- My mixing is perfect, dude.

2180
02:05:02,313 --> 02:05:03,230
Uncle!

2181
02:05:04,230 --> 02:05:05,687
I will ask you something.
Don't get worked up.

2182
02:05:05,688 --> 02:05:08,021
You first ask. Then I'll decide
whether to get worked up or not.

2183
02:05:08,188 --> 02:05:09,313
Uncle, here's your drink.

2184
02:05:11,980 --> 02:05:13,896
- Guys are asking for a bachelor party.
- Go ahead, throw one.

2185
02:05:14,146 --> 02:05:15,063
Take them away.

2186
02:05:16,063 --> 02:05:17,063
Not here, but in the US.

2187
02:05:17,313 --> 02:05:19,396
Do you mean
the United States of America?

2188
02:05:19,896 --> 02:05:21,562
I will return two days before the wedding.

2189
02:05:21,563 --> 02:05:23,021
- You want to go?
- Yes, Uncle.

2190
02:05:23,688 --> 02:05:24,937
Take permission from Adhithi.

2191
02:05:24,938 --> 02:05:26,271
Why should I ask for her permission?

2192
02:05:26,396 --> 02:05:28,937
Go to her. She's going to be your wife.
You need her permission.

2193
02:05:28,938 --> 02:05:30,687
- You tell me, Uncle.
- Don't feel shy.

2194
02:05:30,688 --> 02:05:32,438
Go and get her permission.

2195
02:05:33,021 --> 02:05:35,063
- What is this, Uncle?
- Go ahead! Stop thinking.

2196
02:05:35,355 --> 02:05:37,396
Idhaya, I don't have a passport.

2197
02:05:37,605 --> 02:05:38,855
Why don't we go to Goa?

2198
02:05:39,271 --> 02:05:40,188
Hey, get lost!

2199
02:05:40,813 --> 02:05:43,438
Go have a fun trip.
You don't need my permission.

2200
02:05:44,480 --> 02:05:46,230
We will be returning only
two days before the wedding.

2201
02:05:46,396 --> 02:05:49,062
I was checking as it'll be
a close call to the wedding.

2202
02:05:49,063 --> 02:05:49,980
We can manage.

2203
02:05:50,980 --> 02:05:52,521
- Hi, Dad.
- What is the son-in-law saying?

2204
02:05:52,896 --> 02:05:54,563
You see, I was telling her…

2205
02:05:54,813 --> 02:05:56,437
There's a business deal happening
in America.

2206
02:05:56,438 --> 02:05:58,562
Trump has given him
an appointment to meet.

2207
02:05:58,563 --> 02:05:59,604
Oh!

2208
02:05:59,605 --> 02:06:01,355
He is asking if it is right
to go with the wedding close by.

2209
02:06:02,105 --> 02:06:04,021
Trump, right?
Please go and meet him.

2210
02:06:04,146 --> 02:06:05,313
You will return
before the wedding, right?

2211
02:06:05,438 --> 02:06:07,646
- I will, Father-in-law.
- Then go ahead.

2212
02:06:08,021 --> 02:06:09,230
Why do you look stunned?

2213
02:06:09,646 --> 02:06:11,687
Trump, he says.
It's usual in politics.

2214
02:06:11,688 --> 02:06:14,063
Listen, when he returns from the US…

2215
02:06:14,230 --> 02:06:16,979
Print a banner, "The Minister's son-in-law
is returning after meeting Trump."

2216
02:06:16,980 --> 02:06:18,563
- This is usual in politics as well.
- Right!

2217
02:06:18,813 --> 02:06:20,021
You guys carry on.

2218
02:06:23,063 --> 02:06:23,980
Thanks.

2219
02:06:28,480 --> 02:06:29,521
I'll miss you, Idhaya.

2220
02:06:33,021 --> 02:06:34,396
You guys are such close friends.

2221
02:06:34,855 --> 02:06:36,688
At least you guys could've
helped him confess his love.

2222
02:06:38,271 --> 02:06:41,813
You're right. Had I helped him,
it wouldn't have been a problem now.

2223
02:06:42,355 --> 02:06:44,480
Now, you realize.
Tomorrow he's getting married.

2224
02:06:44,646 --> 02:06:45,563
Go to sleep.

2225
02:06:46,230 --> 02:06:48,146
I'm going to sleep.

2226
02:07:05,146 --> 02:07:06,938
Looks like someone hasn't moved on.

2227
02:07:08,896 --> 02:07:10,896
He's not worth that right now.

2228
02:07:11,146 --> 02:07:12,605
I'm just a nice person, you know.

2229
02:07:14,771 --> 02:07:17,729
Sir, do you know
what happened in America?

2230
02:07:17,730 --> 02:07:19,770
Hey, I'll throw you out of the plane.

2231
02:07:19,771 --> 02:07:21,230
- Shut up and sleep.
- Okay, sir.

2232
02:07:25,230 --> 02:07:28,021
Bro, close your eyes and sleep for a bit.

2233
02:07:28,688 --> 02:07:30,771
No matter what,
only good things will happen.

2234
02:07:31,438 --> 02:07:32,355
Sleep.

2235
02:07:44,188 --> 02:07:46,730
Hey, what did you say
happened in America?

2236
02:08:07,396 --> 02:08:09,938
From what I'm hearing,
I don't think we're returning to India.

2237
02:08:10,605 --> 02:08:13,063
I had a doubt when you brought us out
so far for the bachelor party.

2238
02:08:13,313 --> 02:08:15,105
That you must've done something.

2239
02:08:15,438 --> 02:08:19,771
I get a feeling that he's here to convert
his Aadhaar Card into a Green Card.

2240
02:08:19,938 --> 02:08:22,438
What's the purpose of telling her
that you loved her?

2241
02:08:22,688 --> 02:08:23,605
You're right!

2242
02:08:24,980 --> 02:08:27,771
I don't know. It's been pricking
my conscience for a while now.

2243
02:08:29,271 --> 02:08:31,355
That too after Amudha spoke to me…

2244
02:08:31,813 --> 02:08:32,980
The feeling became stronger.

2245
02:08:36,813 --> 02:08:40,480
When a married woman mustered
the courage to speak her heart…

2246
02:08:41,146 --> 02:08:44,771
I cannot keep this locked in my heart,
get married, and lead a new life.

2247
02:08:46,105 --> 02:08:47,230
For two days, leave me alone.

2248
02:08:48,896 --> 02:08:49,938
I'll meet Sam…

2249
02:08:50,605 --> 02:08:52,146
If I tell her, I'd feel light, guys.

2250
02:08:54,146 --> 02:08:56,605
At the end of the day, it's still
my bachelor's party, so have fun.

2251
02:08:56,730 --> 02:08:57,980
- Correct!
- Okay!

2252
02:08:58,688 --> 02:09:00,813
We're convinced.
Let's enjoy the trip.

2253
02:10:02,271 --> 02:10:03,188
Hi!

2254
02:10:06,521 --> 02:10:07,438
Wait, I'll come out.

2255
02:10:08,188 --> 02:10:10,105
Tell me, what are you doing here?

2256
02:10:11,563 --> 02:10:14,396
I am here on a small business trip.

2257
02:10:15,021 --> 02:10:16,230
At NASA?

2258
02:10:16,980 --> 02:10:18,146
I have a meeting in New York.

2259
02:10:18,980 --> 02:10:21,230
I had some time to kill,
so I came to look around NASA.

2260
02:10:22,146 --> 02:10:23,063
Not bad!

2261
02:10:23,521 --> 02:10:25,896
Are you interested in NASA and astronomy?

2262
02:10:26,771 --> 02:10:27,688
It's all because of you.

2263
02:10:28,646 --> 02:10:29,563
Oh, oh!

2264
02:10:32,313 --> 02:10:35,271
Since school, you've shown
interest in space, rocket science, etc.

2265
02:10:36,021 --> 02:10:38,521
Back then,
I thought you lied about it.

2266
02:10:39,438 --> 02:10:41,938
But not bad.
You've come a long way, Sam.

2267
02:10:43,438 --> 02:10:44,355
Thank you.

2268
02:10:44,855 --> 02:10:48,438
You know, it's been six months
since I saw a known face.

2269
02:10:49,355 --> 02:10:51,688
Seeing you here feels like
I traveled to Madurai.

2270
02:10:53,855 --> 02:10:55,521
Suddenly, I'm missing everyone.

2271
02:10:57,980 --> 02:10:59,355
Maybe that's why I'm here.

2272
02:11:01,646 --> 02:11:02,563
What did you say?

2273
02:11:03,605 --> 02:11:04,521
Nothing!

2274
02:11:06,646 --> 02:11:08,438
Don't you use this rocket
for your missions?

2275
02:11:12,230 --> 02:11:13,730
We just returned from a mission.

2276
02:11:13,896 --> 02:11:15,313
- Oh!
- So, we're on a break now.

2277
02:11:15,688 --> 02:11:17,896
We're currently conducting
Stem-Programs for students.

2278
02:11:18,521 --> 02:11:20,271
Wow! Super!

2279
02:11:27,063 --> 02:11:28,938
Actually,
I'll be visiting New York this weekend.

2280
02:11:29,146 --> 02:11:30,646
If you're free, we can catch up.

2281
02:11:35,105 --> 02:11:36,980
Unless you're with someone.

2282
02:11:37,813 --> 02:11:39,688
No, no! I'm here alone.

2283
02:11:40,980 --> 02:11:42,688
Okay! I'll see you in New York.

2284
02:12:08,230 --> 02:12:09,605
<i>O heart of mine</i>

2285
02:12:10,563 --> 02:12:12,771
<i>Are you the spark that sows love?</i>

2286
02:12:16,355 --> 02:12:20,396
<i>Your heart carries countless stories</i>

2287
02:12:24,230 --> 02:12:25,563
<i>O heart of mine</i>

2288
02:12:26,438 --> 02:12:28,813
<i>Are you the spark that sows love?</i>

2289
02:12:32,271 --> 02:12:36,480
<i>Your heart carries countless stories</i>

2290
02:12:39,188 --> 02:12:44,605
<i>Who are you, wayfarer?</i>

2291
02:12:47,188 --> 02:12:52,521
<i>You're but a passing traveler</i>

2292
02:12:55,271 --> 02:13:00,646
<i>Who are you, wayfarer?</i>

2293
02:13:03,230 --> 02:13:08,646
<i>You're but a passing traveler</i>

2294
02:13:43,855 --> 02:13:47,355
<i>Feet that won't take flight,
Eyes that cannot soar</i>

2295
02:13:47,646 --> 02:13:51,313
<i>Why soar across the sky
To reach the distant beyond?</i>

2296
02:13:51,688 --> 02:13:55,355
<i>Blooms unfold in every direction,
Filling the world with vibrant hues</i>

2297
02:13:55,646 --> 02:13:59,687
<i>Every path I find here
Sets my restless heart adrift</i>

2298
02:13:59,688 --> 02:14:02,980
<i>Hey, Idhaya,
Don't flutter like a butterfly</i>

2299
02:14:03,188 --> 02:14:07,271
<i>Hey, my heart,
Don't grow weary thinking about it</i>

2300
02:14:07,688 --> 02:14:11,354
<i>Don't lose yourself
Searching for what lies ahead</i>

2301
02:14:11,355 --> 02:14:15,605
<i>Idhaya, don't squander your happiness</i>

2302
02:14:16,396 --> 02:14:19,937
<i>What is it that you need?
Tell me, won't you?</i>

2303
02:14:19,938 --> 02:14:23,688
<i>Keep fighting,
And you'll make it yours</i>

2304
02:14:24,063 --> 02:14:27,396
<i>You're lightning itself
So why this heart of stone?</i>

2305
02:14:27,771 --> 02:14:31,563
<i>I left you and soared away,
Yet my heart was brought to its knees</i>

2306
02:14:31,938 --> 02:14:35,438
<i>You're going away
You're my very soul, aren't you?</i>

2307
02:14:51,813 --> 02:14:55,605
<i>Let my heart beat louder than ever</i>

2308
02:14:55,896 --> 02:14:59,480
<i>Let the dream lingering in my eyes
Fall into my hands</i>

2309
02:14:59,855 --> 02:15:03,688
<i>May this faltering heart tell our story</i>

2310
02:15:04,146 --> 02:15:08,063
<i>May everything in our lives
Unfold beautifully</i>

2311
02:15:23,355 --> 02:15:24,355
<i>O heart of mine...</i>

2312
02:15:44,938 --> 02:15:46,521
Hey, Sis, did you reach Chennai?

2313
02:15:47,188 --> 02:15:49,063
Yeah, I reached!
What are you up to?

2314
02:15:49,730 --> 02:15:50,730
I'm heading out.

2315
02:15:51,646 --> 02:15:52,605
Where are you heading?

2316
02:15:54,521 --> 02:15:55,480
To propose my love.

2317
02:15:57,938 --> 02:16:00,646
- Damn you, girl!
- I don't know if you remember.

2318
02:16:00,980 --> 02:16:04,063
He used to come to the same
coaching and tennis classes.

2319
02:16:04,563 --> 02:16:06,271
He even visited our house on our birthday.

2320
02:16:06,480 --> 02:16:08,188
- <i>Idhaya!</i>
- Oh, that guy!

2321
02:16:08,438 --> 02:16:10,396
He used to check me out at coaching class.

2322
02:16:11,271 --> 02:16:12,771
He would've checked you out,
thinking it was me.

2323
02:16:13,563 --> 02:16:16,313
How come suddenly you're in love?

2324
02:16:16,646 --> 02:16:18,438
It's not easy to impress you.

2325
02:16:20,771 --> 02:16:24,646
You know, when someone
keeps crossing paths in your life…

2326
02:16:24,896 --> 02:16:26,563
It may not be a coincidence.

2327
02:16:28,063 --> 02:16:29,480
I feel it's more than that.

2328
02:16:29,980 --> 02:16:32,146
These corny dialogues
don't work even in cinemas now.

2329
02:16:32,480 --> 02:16:33,480
Am I right, baby?

2330
02:16:34,188 --> 02:16:36,687
You're demotivating me.
I'm hanging up.

2331
02:16:36,688 --> 02:16:38,480
He's leaving tomorrow.
I must propose to him tonight.

2332
02:16:39,063 --> 02:16:40,730
- All the best.
- Thanks, Sis.

2333
02:16:47,188 --> 02:16:48,771
We postponed our tickets three times now.

2334
02:16:49,730 --> 02:16:51,688
Uncle has been calling me continuously.

2335
02:16:52,105 --> 02:16:54,730
Only if we leave tomorrow will it work.
If not, forget about your wedding.

2336
02:16:55,271 --> 02:16:56,688
Give me some time to think.

2337
02:16:57,063 --> 02:16:59,521
What are you thinking about?
What more do you want to think about?

2338
02:17:13,396 --> 02:17:15,938
You're feeling emotional,
as if it were a fresh proposal.

2339
02:17:16,730 --> 02:17:18,438
You're going to tell
that you loved her, right?

2340
02:17:18,563 --> 02:17:20,313
Or do you love her?

2341
02:17:20,688 --> 02:17:22,313
Hey, you promised me.

2342
02:17:22,980 --> 02:17:26,521
<i>Dude, this does not involve emotions.
You're here just to share information.</i>

2343
02:17:26,771 --> 02:17:27,688
<i>Bear that in mind.</i>

2344
02:17:28,105 --> 02:17:29,854
From the looks of it…

2345
02:17:29,855 --> 02:17:32,604
I feel it's not his past love
but his present love.

2346
02:17:32,605 --> 02:17:34,896
Hey, Prabhu, don't encourage him.

2347
02:17:35,105 --> 02:17:38,230
He's already engaged.
Who's going to explain to Adhithi?

2348
02:17:38,355 --> 02:17:41,230
<i>Only we're discussing it.
He's sitting here silently.</i>

2349
02:17:42,105 --> 02:17:44,063
Hey, open your mouth
and say something.

2350
02:17:44,480 --> 02:17:47,313
Dude, you hung out for ten days
with her to your heart's desire.

2351
02:17:47,438 --> 02:17:49,813
<i>Now don't go and propose to her.
That'll mess with her mind.</i>

2352
02:17:49,980 --> 02:17:51,354
<i>Your wedding is the day after.</i>

2353
02:17:51,355 --> 02:17:55,479
Dude, use inky-pinky-ponky and
choose who you'd want to live with.

2354
02:17:55,480 --> 02:17:57,230
He might do it.
Please shut up.

2355
02:17:58,730 --> 02:18:00,563
Will you all please stop talking?

2356
02:18:00,896 --> 02:18:03,688
Hey, first, do what you came here for.

2357
02:18:04,438 --> 02:18:06,230
Tell Sam about your wedding.

2358
02:18:06,480 --> 02:18:07,771
<i>After that, we'll leave for India.</i>

2359
02:18:08,021 --> 02:18:10,563
Hey, Idhaya, we're talking to you.

2360
02:18:10,813 --> 02:18:11,813
Say something, damn it.

2361
02:18:11,980 --> 02:18:13,229
Idhaya, please say something.

2362
02:18:13,230 --> 02:18:14,230
Everyone is asking you.

2363
02:18:15,230 --> 02:18:16,188
Answer them, Idhaya.

2364
02:18:22,355 --> 02:18:24,313
I'm sure you have a lie ready
for this situation, too.

2365
02:18:25,688 --> 02:18:28,688
These ten days,
how much have you lied to me?

2366
02:18:29,271 --> 02:18:32,646
"I came to meet an investor.
I came alone. I'm single."

2367
02:18:32,855 --> 02:18:34,688
Sam, you've misunderstood him.

2368
02:18:35,063 --> 02:18:36,271
You guys, please don't say anything.

2369
02:18:37,146 --> 02:18:38,605
Weren't you guys in on it?

2370
02:18:46,688 --> 02:18:49,188
I've never met a horrible person like you.

2371
02:18:50,855 --> 02:18:51,771
Sam!

2372
02:18:53,063 --> 02:18:53,980
Sam!

2373
02:19:04,938 --> 02:19:06,188
Sam! Sam!

2374
02:19:06,480 --> 02:19:08,188
Sam, please hear me out.

2375
02:19:08,896 --> 02:19:10,354
What more do you have
to lie about, Idhaya?

2376
02:19:10,355 --> 02:19:11,271
Go ahead.

2377
02:19:12,938 --> 02:19:14,313
I did not lie, Sam.

2378
02:19:15,396 --> 02:19:17,105
Look, I came here specifically to see you.

2379
02:19:17,313 --> 02:19:18,230
I don't get it!

2380
02:19:18,771 --> 02:19:21,146
How could you meet me when
you're getting married in a few weeks?

2381
02:19:22,938 --> 02:19:25,105
You've misunderstood me, Sam.
You're getting it all wrong.

2382
02:19:26,480 --> 02:19:27,813
Only now do I understand it clearly.

2383
02:19:28,521 --> 02:19:30,771
You're here to celebrate
your bachelor's party.

2384
02:19:31,396 --> 02:19:33,396
And all you want
is a girl to have fun with.

2385
02:19:35,396 --> 02:19:36,896
You freaking used me.

2386
02:19:38,396 --> 02:19:40,438
Listen! Your anger is fair.

2387
02:19:40,813 --> 02:19:42,604
I should've told you
about my wedding on the first day.

2388
02:19:42,605 --> 02:19:44,146
But I don't know why I didn't.

2389
02:19:44,771 --> 02:19:46,604
You've said it now. I'm leaving!

2390
02:19:46,605 --> 02:19:48,605
Sam! Sam, please let me speak.

2391
02:19:49,188 --> 02:19:50,730
At least, hear me out.

2392
02:19:51,605 --> 02:19:52,813
What's left to talk about, Idhaya?

2393
02:19:54,480 --> 02:19:55,813
You hung out with me for ten days.

2394
02:19:56,938 --> 02:19:58,771
Next, you'd invite me to your wedding.

2395
02:19:59,438 --> 02:20:00,355
No…

2396
02:20:00,980 --> 02:20:02,605
Do I look like a bitch to you?

2397
02:20:04,230 --> 02:20:06,813
At least be true to the girl
you're getting married to, Idhaya.

2398
02:20:07,896 --> 02:20:10,646
I don't care what you think about me, Sam.
I'll say what I came here to say.

2399
02:20:10,855 --> 02:20:11,855
Listen, I've always been--

2400
02:20:15,355 --> 02:20:17,521
Even now, you're only
thinking about yourself.

2401
02:20:18,688 --> 02:20:19,855
You never considered my feelings.

2402
02:20:22,896 --> 02:20:23,813
Get lost!

2403
02:21:06,730 --> 02:21:07,980
Hey, that's mine.

2404
02:21:08,188 --> 02:21:10,062
As it is, you're carrying
too much baggage.

2405
02:21:10,063 --> 02:21:11,271
And you want mine, too.
Give it to me.

2406
02:21:13,521 --> 02:21:14,563
- Okay.
- Sir.

2407
02:21:15,021 --> 02:21:16,480
You're leaving without saying anything.

2408
02:21:17,021 --> 02:21:19,105
- Oh, I forgot! Happy married life!
- I didn't mean that.

2409
02:21:19,646 --> 02:21:20,895
Sir, sir, sir, sir!

2410
02:21:20,896 --> 02:21:23,646
So, sir, where are you
headed for breakfast?

2411
02:21:23,771 --> 02:21:26,062
Madhampatty Rangaraj Catering.
You could come to the wedding.

2412
02:21:26,063 --> 02:21:27,688
- No, no, no, no!
- Please join us, sir.

2413
02:21:27,813 --> 02:21:29,063
My body can't take another plot twist.

2414
02:21:29,230 --> 02:21:30,520
I have a lot of work.
Spare me!

2415
02:21:30,521 --> 02:21:31,438
- Bye, bye, bye!
- Sir, please!

2416
02:21:32,563 --> 02:21:33,563
Where are you?

2417
02:21:33,855 --> 02:21:34,813
I've arrived!

2418
02:21:35,105 --> 02:21:36,729
<i>- I'm at the exit gate.</i>
- I'm at the arrival gate.

2419
02:21:36,730 --> 02:21:37,730
<i>Where are you?</i>

2420
02:21:52,521 --> 02:21:55,271
Teacher!
Hey, that's Geetha teacher.

2421
02:21:55,605 --> 02:21:57,313
- Teacher!
- Teacher!

2422
02:22:00,021 --> 02:22:01,646
- Who is she?
- It's our Geetha teacher.

2423
02:22:01,771 --> 02:22:03,230
She's our favorite teacher.

2424
02:22:04,188 --> 02:22:06,271
- Geetha teacher?
- Yes, Geetha teacher.

2425
02:22:11,688 --> 02:22:13,812
<i>He left a pregnant woman alone
on the verge of delivery.</i>

2426
02:22:13,813 --> 02:22:15,396
<i>He must be a classic jerk.</i>

2427
02:22:18,605 --> 02:22:20,271
Is this what you guys felt about him?

2428
02:22:22,230 --> 02:22:24,438
Sorry, ma'am, we were young,
and it was unintentional.

2429
02:22:24,646 --> 02:22:25,605
Not an issue.

2430
02:22:26,438 --> 02:22:27,771
What have you decided now?

2431
02:22:31,063 --> 02:22:31,980
I don't know.

2432
02:22:32,521 --> 02:22:35,188
Do whatever your heart says, Idhaya.

2433
02:22:37,063 --> 02:22:39,438
Ma'am, your husband says
that he's got some work.

2434
02:22:39,771 --> 02:22:41,271
At least you can come
to Idhaya's wedding.

2435
02:22:41,438 --> 02:22:43,438
- It'll be fun!
- Yeah, you should.

2436
02:22:43,688 --> 02:22:47,230
If you let them, they would narrate
a flashback to everyone.

2437
02:22:47,355 --> 02:22:48,813
Your uncle is waiting.
Leave!

2438
02:22:49,146 --> 02:22:50,896
- Sir?
- Sir?

2439
02:22:51,271 --> 02:22:52,271
We're more than this.

2440
02:22:52,521 --> 02:22:53,813
No! Leave now!

2441
02:22:54,230 --> 02:22:55,271
Hey, let's go.

2442
02:22:55,771 --> 02:22:56,980
- See you, Teacher.
- Bye.

2443
02:22:57,313 --> 02:22:58,146
Bye.

2444
02:22:58,688 --> 02:22:59,563
See you!

2445
02:23:04,271 --> 02:23:05,812
Even on the wedding day,
you guys arrive late.

2446
02:23:05,813 --> 02:23:06,770
They'll be here soon!

2447
02:23:06,771 --> 02:23:07,730
Look, they've arrived.

2448
02:23:08,105 --> 02:23:09,813
Welcome. Please, welcome.

2449
02:23:10,563 --> 02:23:11,521
- Greetings.
- In-law!

2450
02:23:11,688 --> 02:23:13,271
Oh, he has arrived.
That's great!

2451
02:23:13,730 --> 02:23:14,646
Hi!

2452
02:23:15,813 --> 02:23:16,854
Dear, greet him.

2453
02:23:16,855 --> 02:23:18,187
You keep me on my toes
until the last minute.

2454
02:23:18,188 --> 02:23:19,730
We're here now! Let's go inside!

2455
02:23:22,188 --> 02:23:23,145
Hi, Priya!

2456
02:23:23,146 --> 02:23:24,105
Welcome, Son-in-law.

2457
02:23:24,355 --> 02:23:26,312
Usually, people wait for me
at the assembly.

2458
02:23:26,313 --> 02:23:27,646
But now you have made me wait for you.

2459
02:23:28,063 --> 02:23:29,604
- I'm sorry.
- It's okay. Please come in.

2460
02:23:29,605 --> 02:23:31,187
Guys, shall we take the groom now?

2461
02:23:31,188 --> 02:23:33,480
- Please take him.
- Come on, let's go.

2462
02:23:34,646 --> 02:23:35,813
Hey, hey! Hey, hey!

2463
02:23:36,188 --> 02:23:37,895
Why are guys coming in batches?
Where is your luggage?

2464
02:23:37,896 --> 02:23:39,895
- The luggage is in the room.
- Did you bring the liquor?

2465
02:23:39,896 --> 02:23:41,812
- We never bought one.
- I asked you to get it duty-free.

2466
02:23:41,813 --> 02:23:43,855
- Uncle, here I come.
- Why is he going without being called?

2467
02:23:44,105 --> 02:23:45,313
I think they didn't buy it.

2468
02:23:46,605 --> 02:23:47,521
Hi!

2469
02:23:47,855 --> 02:23:50,105
Uncle, I want to talk to you.

2470
02:23:59,396 --> 02:24:01,480
Hey, Idhaya, are you kidding?

2471
02:24:02,813 --> 02:24:04,605
All the city's VIPs are here.

2472
02:24:05,063 --> 02:24:07,021
How could you even think
of calling off the wedding?

2473
02:24:07,771 --> 02:24:09,563
Only after you said yes
did I go ahead with this marriage.

2474
02:24:09,688 --> 02:24:11,437
You were with that girl
for the past six months

2475
02:24:11,438 --> 02:24:13,479
but now you don't want her.

2476
02:24:13,480 --> 02:24:14,730
What would people think about us?

2477
02:24:15,605 --> 02:24:18,021
Forget people.
What do I tell Adhithi?

2478
02:24:20,271 --> 02:24:22,188
Have I ever said no to anything
you've asked of me?

2479
02:24:22,605 --> 02:24:24,730
Or have I forced you to do anything?

2480
02:24:25,855 --> 02:24:27,063
Please understand the situation.

2481
02:24:27,188 --> 02:24:28,688
Adhithi is the right match for you.

2482
02:24:29,480 --> 02:24:31,980
When we don't get what we wish for,
it does hurt.

2483
02:24:32,271 --> 02:24:34,646
But if we don't get what we need,
our life will be ruined.

2484
02:24:34,896 --> 02:24:35,813
Please understand.

2485
02:24:36,063 --> 02:24:38,605
Look, I'm not just your uncle,

2486
02:24:38,896 --> 02:24:40,355
I'm your parent as well.

2487
02:24:40,813 --> 02:24:43,021
If you feel the same way,
for God's sake, come to the wedding.

2488
02:24:43,646 --> 02:24:45,062
It's time! They're calling for the groom.

2489
02:24:45,063 --> 02:24:46,105
Hey, I'll be out! Get lost!

2490
02:25:11,980 --> 02:25:14,688
You want me to call off this wedding?

2491
02:25:16,271 --> 02:25:19,438
Okay.
No matter what, I'll face everything.

2492
02:25:20,771 --> 02:25:22,021
You don't worry about it.

2493
02:25:23,188 --> 02:25:25,813
I'll handle it. I'll face it.

2494
02:25:26,313 --> 02:25:27,230
Fine!

2495
02:25:27,480 --> 02:25:28,938
Not an issue. I'll handle it.

2496
02:25:29,605 --> 02:25:32,146
Uncle, bring me my wedding clothes.

2497
02:25:33,063 --> 02:25:34,605
I'll be ready in five minutes.

2498
02:25:37,521 --> 02:25:39,938
Idhaya, I'll convince everyone.

2499
02:25:40,063 --> 02:25:41,396
You don't have to say anything.

2500
02:25:41,730 --> 02:25:42,646
I'm at fault.

2501
02:25:43,271 --> 02:25:44,396
You go ahead. I'll follow shortly.

2502
02:25:45,563 --> 02:25:47,980
Listen, don't confuse yourself.

2503
02:25:48,146 --> 02:25:49,605
I want only what you wish for.

2504
02:25:49,813 --> 02:25:50,730
Am I right, Son?

2505
02:25:52,355 --> 02:25:53,271
Okay.

2506
02:26:00,771 --> 02:26:03,146
<i>- Sachin bro, you are saved for now.
- Yes, Dravid!</i>

2507
02:26:03,313 --> 02:26:04,438
Hey, Uncle!

2508
02:26:05,063 --> 02:26:06,771
I upheld my promise
and brought Idhaya on time.

2509
02:26:07,771 --> 02:26:09,313
I understood your plan.

2510
02:26:09,813 --> 02:26:10,730
What plan?

2511
02:26:11,230 --> 02:26:14,229
You're pretending to get ready for the
wedding but you're planning to cancel it.

2512
02:26:14,230 --> 02:26:15,146
Isn't that your plan?

2513
02:26:15,355 --> 02:26:17,396
If I were in your situation,
I would've planned the same.

2514
02:26:17,938 --> 02:26:18,937
What's the point of friendship

2515
02:26:18,938 --> 02:26:20,771
if you don't
help your friend be with the one he loves?

2516
02:26:21,146 --> 02:26:22,438
I won't let it happen.

2517
02:26:22,980 --> 02:26:24,437
He will get married to Adhithi.

2518
02:26:24,438 --> 02:26:26,188
That's good for him,
and he has understood it.

2519
02:26:26,688 --> 02:26:28,021
I expect you guys
to understand it as well.

2520
02:26:28,521 --> 02:26:30,980
Instead, if you think of
doing something stupid…

2521
02:26:31,313 --> 02:26:32,480
I won't spare you guys.

2522
02:26:32,938 --> 02:26:33,855
Hey!

2523
02:26:34,646 --> 02:26:37,063
- You look suspicious to me.
- Don't worry about me, Uncle.

2524
02:26:40,271 --> 02:26:43,188
How come we didn't think about
what Uncle just said about Idhaya?

2525
02:26:43,480 --> 02:26:46,063
It's our duty to help Idhaya
unite with his true love.

2526
02:26:46,271 --> 02:26:47,605
Only then are we responsible friends.

2527
02:26:47,771 --> 02:26:49,313
We're not good friends, dude.

2528
02:26:50,063 --> 02:26:51,980
- Damn!
- What can we do about it now?

2529
02:26:52,105 --> 02:26:53,105
We'll cancel the wedding.

2530
02:26:54,271 --> 02:26:55,813
We unite Idhaya and Samantha.

2531
02:26:56,313 --> 02:26:57,396
Okay, we'll unite them!

2532
02:26:57,521 --> 02:26:59,230
- Yeah, we'll unite them.
- Yes, guys!

2533
02:26:59,396 --> 02:27:00,688
I won't let it happen!

2534
02:27:01,355 --> 02:27:03,437
Hey, Team America.
I'm Team Adhithi.

2535
02:27:03,438 --> 02:27:04,855
- Adhithi?
- Yes!

2536
02:27:05,188 --> 02:27:06,771
I will make sure your plan fails

2537
02:27:06,938 --> 02:27:08,521
and unite Adhithi and Idhaya.

2538
02:27:08,646 --> 02:27:09,896
I swear on Uncle.

2539
02:27:10,188 --> 02:27:11,104
I'm leaving!

2540
02:27:11,105 --> 02:27:12,021
Hey, Juju!

2541
02:27:12,146 --> 02:27:13,062
- Hey Juju!
- Hey!

2542
02:27:13,063 --> 02:27:14,312
Brother, ignore him.

2543
02:27:14,313 --> 02:27:16,105
He's pissed off because we didn't
get him whiskey from the US.

2544
02:27:16,313 --> 02:27:17,730
- Let's follow our plan.
- Guys, please focus.

2545
02:27:17,938 --> 02:27:20,146
We only have two hours left.
Let's go!

2546
02:27:20,813 --> 02:27:22,562
Many VIPs are dining tonight.

2547
02:27:22,563 --> 02:27:24,937
Make sure to add
plenty of dried fruit in the dessert.

2548
02:27:24,938 --> 02:27:26,896
Set dried fruits aside.
There are more pressing issues to tend to.

2549
02:27:27,563 --> 02:27:28,480
Take a look.

2550
02:27:31,188 --> 02:27:32,104
What the hell is this?

2551
02:27:32,105 --> 02:27:33,520
- Sir.
- He's my friend.

2552
02:27:33,521 --> 02:27:35,270
Still, it's a matter of a girl's life.

2553
02:27:35,271 --> 02:27:38,062
Please manage to stop this wedding
and save a girl's life.

2554
02:27:38,063 --> 02:27:40,021
- Hey! Hey!
- Take a look at this, sir.

2555
02:27:41,438 --> 02:27:43,437
- Two people!
- How did this happen?

2556
02:27:43,438 --> 02:27:46,145
I've never touched another woman
other than my wife.

2557
02:27:46,146 --> 02:27:48,562
I don't understand how I ended up
putting my arms around these girls.

2558
02:27:48,563 --> 02:27:50,062
- It's AI.
- What does it mean?

2559
02:27:50,063 --> 02:27:52,562
Using this, we can make a good person
look bad, and a bad person look good.

2560
02:27:52,563 --> 02:27:54,312
Also, we can turn truth into a lie
and a lie into truth.

2561
02:27:54,313 --> 02:27:55,562
We can do anything we want.

2562
02:27:55,563 --> 02:27:56,521
They're from a news channel.

2563
02:27:57,105 --> 02:28:00,438
They're planning to get
you trapped in a scandal.

2564
02:28:01,063 --> 02:28:04,021
- The groom is a noble person like you.
- Damn, he's ruining our plan.

2565
02:28:04,563 --> 02:28:06,187
Thank goodness you saved me.

2566
02:28:06,188 --> 02:28:07,396
I almost believed them.

2567
02:28:07,813 --> 02:28:10,437
Hey, he explained that it's all AI.
I know now.

2568
02:28:10,438 --> 02:28:11,563
Mind your business!

2569
02:28:12,105 --> 02:28:14,813
Team America -0.
Team Adhithi -1.

2570
02:28:14,938 --> 02:28:17,104
- I'll meet you in round 2.
- Hey, what's wrong with him?

2571
02:28:17,105 --> 02:28:18,646
Dude, come on, let's plan something else.

2572
02:28:19,105 --> 02:28:20,187
- Hi, bro!
- Hi, bro!

2573
02:28:20,188 --> 02:28:22,396
- Greetings, are you the DJ?
- Greetings, I'm the DJ.

2574
02:28:22,605 --> 02:28:24,396
Bro, you must play a song now.

2575
02:28:24,730 --> 02:28:27,646
That should make the groom throw away
the garland and run off the stage.

2576
02:28:27,813 --> 02:28:28,812
It should move him.

2577
02:28:28,813 --> 02:28:30,354
I got you, bro!
What kind of song?

2578
02:28:30,355 --> 02:28:32,605
"All of me, someone like you…"
Like these songs?

2579
02:28:32,730 --> 02:28:34,605
- If you play these, they'll doze off.
- Is it?

2580
02:28:34,980 --> 02:28:36,688
Please play the songs on this list.

2581
02:28:36,813 --> 02:28:38,146
Everything else will happen on its own.

2582
02:28:42,063 --> 02:28:43,895
- Bro.. I got you, brother.
- Play it!

2583
02:28:43,896 --> 02:28:44,813
I got you.

2584
02:28:55,105 --> 02:28:57,771
{\an8}<i>O Heart of mine</i>

2585
02:28:58,021 --> 02:29:00,980
<i>You're one of a kind</i>

2586
02:29:01,146 --> 02:29:03,355
<i>O Heart of mine</i>

2587
02:29:03,771 --> 02:29:06,396
<i>My throbbing love</i>

2588
02:29:06,688 --> 02:29:12,520
<i>For wisdom and flesh alike,
The journey is endless</i>

2589
02:29:12,521 --> 02:29:18,021
<i>Every dream whispers to the heart...</i>

2590
02:29:29,021 --> 02:29:32,355
So, you lied to me and went to America.

2591
02:29:32,896 --> 02:29:34,271
That's not the problem now.

2592
02:29:34,563 --> 02:29:36,271
Give me an idea to call off the wedding.

2593
02:29:43,563 --> 02:29:46,855
Bro, what kind of songs are you playing?
It doesn't give any wedding vibes.

2594
02:29:47,313 --> 02:29:49,395
Bro, I know what to do.

2595
02:29:49,396 --> 02:29:51,271
Don't tell me how to do my job.

2596
02:29:51,605 --> 02:29:52,771
If you keep up this nonsense…

2597
02:29:53,021 --> 02:29:54,771
Only the equipment will leave this place,
not you.

2598
02:29:55,688 --> 02:29:57,479
- Bro, bro, bro, bro…
- Play rocking songs!

2599
02:29:57,480 --> 02:29:59,813
Bro, I'm bad at this language.

2600
02:29:59,938 --> 02:30:01,313
Language is never a problem.

2601
02:30:01,563 --> 02:30:03,646
The song should be rocking!

2602
02:30:05,688 --> 02:30:07,896
I think this should work for you, brother.

2603
02:30:54,480 --> 02:30:55,521
Sit here.

2604
02:30:57,105 --> 02:30:58,021
Hello!

2605
02:31:04,938 --> 02:31:07,188
- It's very wrong of you.
- What did I do wrong?

2606
02:31:07,730 --> 02:31:09,105
You should've gone with Idhaya.

2607
02:31:09,563 --> 02:31:11,229
He called you along for moral support.

2608
02:31:11,230 --> 02:31:12,605
It was wrong of you to avoid him.

2609
02:31:12,730 --> 02:31:14,313
It's his life.
He must make a decision.

2610
02:31:14,813 --> 02:31:15,730
Oh!

2611
02:31:16,313 --> 02:31:18,396
It was your wife and child.

2612
02:31:18,730 --> 02:31:20,771
But he never waited,
thinking it was your responsibility.

2613
02:31:21,355 --> 02:31:24,938
You don't have the magnanimity
that young kid had.

2614
02:31:25,646 --> 02:31:27,105
Are you seriously comparing me to him?

2615
02:31:27,813 --> 02:31:30,688
You didn't want to take a leave
when I went into labor.

2616
02:31:30,938 --> 02:31:33,105
But he signed the form and was with me.

2617
02:31:37,105 --> 02:31:39,396
To you, the Swiss were important.

2618
02:31:39,605 --> 02:31:41,730
To him, his teacher was important.

2619
02:31:45,688 --> 02:31:48,063
You were running to build a future.

2620
02:31:48,480 --> 02:31:50,730
But he came looking for his teacher.

2621
02:31:54,938 --> 02:31:57,646
- He was there with me--
- Dear, please stop!

2622
02:31:58,438 --> 02:32:00,688
The more you talk,

2623
02:32:00,938 --> 02:32:04,355
my ears are ringing with
a melodramatic background score.

2624
02:32:06,605 --> 02:32:09,605
I'm convinced.
We'll leave right away for the wedding.

2625
02:32:11,063 --> 02:32:12,730
- Lado, decorations look good.
- Hello, ma'am.

2626
02:32:14,396 --> 02:32:15,938
What's going to happen now?

2627
02:32:17,271 --> 02:32:18,688
- The wedding will happen.
- Sir?

2628
02:32:21,105 --> 02:32:22,521
Madhampatty Catering.

2629
02:32:22,730 --> 02:32:24,188
I'm going to feast today.

2630
02:32:24,313 --> 02:32:25,855
- Sir, what do we do?
- Thank you.

2631
02:32:27,313 --> 02:32:28,271
What's with sassing?

2632
02:32:29,271 --> 02:32:32,188
We brought the love of his life to him.

2633
02:32:32,688 --> 02:32:35,105
If this does not bowl him over,
I don't know what else would.

2634
02:32:35,230 --> 02:32:36,146
Let's see!

2635
02:32:37,021 --> 02:32:41,355
Son, Son-in-law, my daughter's groom,

2636
02:32:41,896 --> 02:32:43,938
our pride and the King of our family.

2637
02:32:44,563 --> 02:32:45,730
You are a masterpiece beyond compare,

2638
02:32:46,146 --> 02:32:47,313
a garland of fragrance,

2639
02:32:47,480 --> 02:32:49,396
a haven of joy,
and a grove that offers solace.

2640
02:32:50,063 --> 02:32:52,230
Sheesh! Will he finish it today?

2641
02:32:52,396 --> 02:32:56,105
Despite being busy with the wedding,
in order to develop his business,

2642
02:32:56,271 --> 02:32:59,854
he went to America
and met President Trump.

2643
02:32:59,855 --> 02:33:02,313
<i>Your sincerity and hard work
have stunned me.</i>

2644
02:33:02,438 --> 02:33:05,145
Sir, he's a martyr
who sacrificed his love for his Uncle.

2645
02:33:05,146 --> 02:33:06,063
Yeah, right.

2646
02:33:06,188 --> 02:33:08,438
Martyrs don't get girls, only a pension.

2647
02:33:08,730 --> 02:33:10,938
He's an old timer. Scrap material.

2648
02:33:11,105 --> 02:33:13,021
What do we do now?
Is there no other option?

2649
02:33:13,396 --> 02:33:15,521
- There's an option.
- What is it, sir?

2650
02:33:15,646 --> 02:33:19,396
I must appreciate his Uncle
for raising an honest person.

2651
02:33:21,063 --> 02:33:23,146
- Sir?
- Let me appreciate him.

2652
02:33:23,813 --> 02:33:24,730
- Sir!
- Sachin, my bro!

2653
02:33:24,855 --> 02:33:26,313
Nice to see you again, sir.

2654
02:33:26,896 --> 02:33:28,188
Uncle, he's our friend.

2655
02:33:29,396 --> 02:33:30,730
- Surya!
- Hello, Surya!

2656
02:33:31,021 --> 02:33:32,021
You both are exceptional.

2657
02:33:32,230 --> 02:33:35,063
I've never seen such a great
uncle-and-nephew combo.

2658
02:33:35,896 --> 02:33:38,813
- He's gold, sir.
- Gold, sir. Truly gold.

2659
02:33:39,188 --> 02:33:40,479
In this day and age,

2660
02:33:40,480 --> 02:33:42,521
no one would sacrifice
the woman he loves for his uncle.

2661
02:33:43,730 --> 02:33:44,646
But he did!

2662
02:33:46,355 --> 02:33:48,896
Don't be afraid.
I won't speak like my father.

2663
02:33:50,438 --> 02:33:53,480
You sacrificed your life for his sake.

2664
02:33:54,063 --> 02:33:57,188
I'm sure he would sacrifice
the love of his life for you.

2665
02:33:58,646 --> 02:33:59,563
But there's one thing…

2666
02:34:00,355 --> 02:34:01,355
His heart will be crying.

2667
02:34:02,855 --> 02:34:04,313
Eventually, he'll be okay.

2668
02:34:04,605 --> 02:34:06,605
You have done a lot for him.

2669
02:34:06,896 --> 02:34:09,271
This is very small compared
to what you did for him.

2670
02:34:09,938 --> 02:34:10,855
He'll be okay.

2671
02:34:14,355 --> 02:34:16,271
Okay, sir. I'll be around.

2672
02:34:16,438 --> 02:34:17,813
I'll stay until everything is over.

2673
02:34:42,271 --> 02:34:43,271
Greetings to all.

2674
02:34:44,980 --> 02:34:46,938
Today is my nephew, Idhaya's wedding.

2675
02:34:47,730 --> 02:34:50,480
He is both a blessing and a cherished
relationship bestowed upon me by God

2676
02:34:50,730 --> 02:34:53,146
so that I don't end up lonely
in this world.

2677
02:34:54,271 --> 02:34:57,813
For 30 years now,
we have lived for each other.

2678
02:34:57,980 --> 02:35:01,105
Until now,
he has never asked me for anything.

2679
02:35:02,188 --> 02:35:06,146
He probably felt that I would be upset
if he asked for it.

2680
02:35:07,063 --> 02:35:08,313
Such a gem of a boy, my Idhaya,

2681
02:35:08,646 --> 02:35:09,896
for the first time,

2682
02:35:10,271 --> 02:35:12,646
he asked me for something
from the bottom of his heart.

2683
02:35:14,021 --> 02:35:15,396
But I denied him.

2684
02:35:16,021 --> 02:35:17,271
But he was not upset about it.

2685
02:35:17,688 --> 02:35:19,063
The life he rightfully deserves,

2686
02:35:19,521 --> 02:35:22,438
he threw it away
to uphold his respect for my word

2687
02:35:22,855 --> 02:35:23,980
and is sitting here to get married.

2688
02:35:26,980 --> 02:35:28,521
If I still remain silent,

2689
02:35:29,146 --> 02:35:32,021
whatever I did till date for him

2690
02:35:33,396 --> 02:35:34,396
would hold no meaning.

2691
02:35:35,021 --> 02:35:37,188
Dear Adhithi, please forgive me.

2692
02:35:38,771 --> 02:35:42,313
I know what you would go through
if this wedding is called off.

2693
02:35:42,688 --> 02:35:43,605
Hey!

2694
02:35:44,646 --> 02:35:46,021
But if we go through with this wedding,

2695
02:35:46,688 --> 02:35:50,063
neither of you will be happy
even for a moment in your lives.

2696
02:35:52,021 --> 02:35:53,021
What's happening?

2697
02:35:53,438 --> 02:35:55,355
Everyone on the stage, please forgive me.

2698
02:35:55,896 --> 02:35:58,980
If you could graciously
cancel this wedding,

2699
02:36:00,230 --> 02:36:02,146
- and help him start his new life...
- What's happening out here?

2700
02:36:02,646 --> 02:36:03,687
Are you kidding me?

2701
02:36:03,688 --> 02:36:05,520
Hey, Siva Subramaniam, come here.

2702
02:36:05,521 --> 02:36:07,480
Nothing's wrong, Chief.
Please wait a minute.

2703
02:36:07,605 --> 02:36:10,063
There's been a confusion.
Nothing's wrong.

2704
02:36:10,938 --> 02:36:12,813
- Adhithi, nothing is wrong.
- Adhithi!

2705
02:36:13,188 --> 02:36:14,855
Dad, hold on!

2706
02:36:15,230 --> 02:36:17,688
Making a fuss
won't make this wedding happen.

2707
02:36:18,146 --> 02:36:19,438
Even if we make it happen,

2708
02:36:19,605 --> 02:36:23,605
how do I marry someone who
does not love me and make a life with him?

2709
02:36:23,896 --> 02:36:25,730
Sorry, sir, please forgive me.

2710
02:36:25,980 --> 02:36:28,020
- You came here to bless us.
- It's okay, dear.

2711
02:36:28,021 --> 02:36:28,938
But…

2712
02:36:30,188 --> 02:36:32,980
I'm sorry,
this wedding is not happening anymore.

2713
02:36:33,438 --> 02:36:35,313
Please forgive us.

2714
02:37:09,271 --> 02:37:10,271
Is the wedding over?

2715
02:37:10,896 --> 02:37:12,146
I didn't hear the nuptial beats.

2716
02:37:14,730 --> 02:37:17,188
To call off the wedding,
you brought his lover.

2717
02:37:17,313 --> 02:37:18,855
Did you ever consider my plight?

2718
02:37:19,021 --> 02:37:20,771
I only thought about <i>your</i> life.

2719
02:37:21,563 --> 02:37:23,771
For whose benefit do you think
I called off the wedding?

2720
02:37:24,313 --> 02:37:25,896
It's for your good.
Hand it to me.

2721
02:37:26,771 --> 02:37:28,271
Are you saying he's a bad man?

2722
02:37:28,480 --> 02:37:31,730
Nah, he's a good man.
That's the problem.

2723
02:37:32,521 --> 02:37:36,313
But don't assume
that he's smart and romantic.

2724
02:37:37,188 --> 02:37:39,813
Even if he's held at gunpoint,
he can't romance.

2725
02:37:41,105 --> 02:37:44,355
Actually, I saved you.

2726
02:37:44,771 --> 02:37:45,688
You owe me, bro.

2727
02:37:48,063 --> 02:37:49,063
Are you trying to convince me?

2728
02:37:50,063 --> 02:37:54,355
On the flight, I listened to his
entire flashback for 16 hours.

2729
02:37:55,521 --> 02:37:59,896
Even 20 years weren't enough for him
to propose to the love of his life.

2730
02:38:00,105 --> 02:38:03,271
He has to fall in love with you
and then propose...

2731
02:38:03,605 --> 02:38:05,438
Imagine for yourself
how long it will take.

2732
02:38:05,730 --> 02:38:06,646
You escaped!

2733
02:38:12,230 --> 02:38:13,521
Girl, that's my cigarette.

2734
02:38:14,813 --> 02:38:16,521
Go and complete what's left.

2735
02:38:17,063 --> 02:38:18,188
We have to end with "All is well."

2736
02:38:22,896 --> 02:38:24,730
Make it up for what you lost
in the coaching class.

2737
02:38:27,146 --> 02:38:29,146
- Where's your twin sister?
- Twin sister?

2738
02:38:30,313 --> 02:38:32,105
Not bad! You identified me.

2739
02:38:34,896 --> 02:38:36,895
- I don't repeat my mistakes.
- Are you not Samantha?

2740
02:38:36,896 --> 02:38:38,770
- Hey…
- Are you serious?

2741
02:38:38,771 --> 02:38:39,688
Did you know?

2742
02:38:39,855 --> 02:38:40,980
I couldn't spot the difference.

2743
02:38:43,313 --> 02:38:44,270
Hello.

2744
02:38:44,271 --> 02:38:46,730
Sir, you kept us in the dark
and surprised us.

2745
02:38:47,021 --> 02:38:50,771
Look, we only had two hours,
and I brought who I could.

2746
02:38:50,938 --> 02:38:52,771
Whatever, we called off the wedding.

2747
02:38:52,938 --> 02:38:53,896
Well done!

2748
02:38:56,730 --> 02:38:58,396
Hey, Idhaya!
Is she not the girl?

2749
02:38:58,855 --> 02:39:00,105
Then who's the girl?

2750
02:39:00,646 --> 02:39:01,771
This girl's sister.

2751
02:39:02,313 --> 02:39:03,813
- Where is she now?
- In America.

2752
02:39:05,188 --> 02:39:07,605
Oh, God, please save me from them.

2753
02:39:07,771 --> 02:39:10,020
{\an8}Chill, Uncle.
We'll take care of it in the sequel.

2754
02:39:10,021 --> 02:39:12,855
{\an8}ALL IS WELL

2755
02:39:31,188 --> 02:39:33,230
Hey, what's your problem?

2756
02:39:33,646 --> 02:39:35,021
Didn't I tell you already?

2757
02:39:36,021 --> 02:39:37,063
He's a good boy.

2758
02:39:37,771 --> 02:39:39,855
Hey, shut up.
I know him well.

2759
02:39:40,480 --> 02:39:41,813
{\an8}We all approve of him.

2760
02:39:42,230 --> 02:39:43,438
{\an8}What have you decided now?

2761
02:39:43,813 --> 02:39:45,521
{\an8}Hey, stop with your drama.

2762
02:39:45,688 --> 02:39:48,020
{\an8}We noticed how cozy you guys were
in New York.

2763
02:39:48,021 --> 02:39:49,187
{\an8}You guys have sung a duet.

2764
02:39:49,188 --> 02:39:50,729
{\an8}Do you still expect him
to make the first move?

2765
02:39:50,730 --> 02:39:51,813
{\an8}You're right!

2766
02:39:52,188 --> 02:39:53,188
{\an8}You want him to come?

2767
02:39:54,146 --> 02:39:56,396
{\an8}Oh, so the entire gang is here.

2768
02:39:56,730 --> 02:39:59,063
{\an8}You can talk all you want.
I reckon he's out there.

2769
02:39:59,563 --> 02:40:01,105
{\an8}Ask him
to look me in the face and propose.

2770
02:40:01,396 --> 02:40:02,646
{\an8}I'll forget about everything.

2771
02:40:03,813 --> 02:40:04,730
{\an8}<i>Dude, come over here.</i>

2772
02:40:05,188 --> 02:40:06,480
{\an8}- Hi, Sam!
- Finally, you appeared.

2773
02:40:07,688 --> 02:40:10,021
{\an8}Except for you, everyone else
is saying that you're in love with me.

2774
02:40:10,230 --> 02:40:12,021
{\an8}This call will last
only for another 40 seconds.

2775
02:40:12,730 --> 02:40:13,730
{\an8}Now's the time for you to say it.

2776
02:40:15,396 --> 02:40:16,730
{\an8}They've switched on the theatre lights.

2777
02:40:17,396 --> 02:40:18,979
{\an8}Hey, look at me.

2778
02:40:18,980 --> 02:40:20,896
{\an8}Rolling credits of the crane operator
is on screen now.

2779
02:40:21,021 --> 02:40:22,896
{\an8}For God's sake,
propose before the rolling titles end.

2780
02:40:23,396 --> 02:40:25,563
{\an8}The audience has started
to look for parking tickets.

2781
02:40:25,730 --> 02:40:26,730
{\an8}Please say it.

2782
02:40:27,271 --> 02:40:29,563
{\an8}I'm feeling shy looking at you
being all shy.

2783
02:40:29,855 --> 02:40:30,771
{\an8}Say it!

2784
02:40:31,646 --> 02:40:32,604
{\an8}Idhaya…

2785
02:40:32,605 --> 02:40:34,313
{\an8}He won't propose. Please leave.

2786
02:40:34,605 --> 02:40:36,438
{\an8}He's never going to muster the courage.

2787
02:40:36,980 --> 02:40:38,105
{\an8}Everyone, please shut up.

2788
02:40:38,355 --> 02:40:39,313
{\an8}I'm going to say it.

2789
02:40:40,480 --> 02:40:41,396
{\an8}I'll handle it.

2790
02:40:43,396 --> 02:40:44,313
{\an8}Super!

2791
02:40:46,271 --> 02:40:47,188
{\an8}Sam…

2792
02:40:49,355 --> 02:40:50,271
{\an8}I--

2793
02:40:51,105 --> 02:40:52,021
{\an8}I…

